swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T16:51:26Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat(ch23): implement complete Chapter 23 Reinforcement Learning visualization suite\n\n- Pure algorithm implementations (src/algorithms/index.ts):\n  §23.2 Passive RL: directUtilityEstimation, passiveTDLearner, passiveADPLearner\n  §23.3 Active RL: qLearningStep, sarsaStep, runQLearning, runSARSA\n  §23.4 Function Approximation: linearFunctionApprox, tdFAUpdate, qFAUpdate\n  §23.5 Policy Gradient: softmaxPolicy, reinforceUpdate\n  §23.6 Inverse RL: computeFeatureExpectations, featureMatchingIRL\n  Grid-world helpers: createGridWorld, sampleTransition, getReward\n\n- React components:\n  GridWorldViz — animated 4×3 grid with Q-Learning/SARSA, heat-map + arrows\n  TDLearningViz — TD(0) utility convergence line chart over trials\n  QLearningViz — Q-table heat map, click-to-inspect, episode controls\n  FunctionApproxViz — θ bar chart, utility grid, step-by-step TD updates\n  PolicyGradientViz — softmax probability bars, REINFORCE gradient updates\n  InverseRLViz — expert trajectory replay, inferred reward heat-map, IRL weights\n\n- Tests: 102 tests with 100% branch + line + statement + function coverage\n- Build: passes, main chunk 43 KB gzipped (well under 500 KB limit)\n- manifest.json: all sections status → ''complete''\n- README.md: full visualization descriptions\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2451b37b75209f29916ebd6ebfebc26333f68008","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/2451b37b75209f29916ebd6ebfebc26333f68008"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/413faf63d4ed7a0a1b86878d310c67d7238096cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/