"date":"2026-03-05T16:41:46Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat(chapter-22): implement Deep Learning visualizations\n\n- Pure algorithm implementations: sigmoid/relu/softplus/tanh activations\n  and their derivatives, softmax, cross-entropy loss, forward pass,\n  backpropagation, training loop, 1D convolution, max pooling, RNN,\n  LSTM, dropout (seeded LCG PRNG), and autoencoder\n- 100% branch + line coverage (95 tests) via Vitest\n- 8 interactive React components with play/pause/step/reset controls,\n  speed slider, keyboard navigation, ARIA labels, and\n  prefers-reduced-motion support:\n  - ActivationFunctionViz: SVG plots of 4 activation functions + derivatives\n  - ForwardPassViz: animated step-by-step network forward pass\n  - BackpropViz: gradient visualization with highlighted edges/nodes\n  - TrainingViz: animated loss curve on XOR dataset\n  - ConvolutionViz: sliding kernel with patch highlighting\n  - RNNViz: unrolled RNN with hidden state flow arrows\n  - LSTMViz: gate bar charts + cell/hidden state history chart\n  - AutoencoderViz: encoder/decoder layer bar charts\n- Updated manifest.json with complete section metadata\n- Updated README.md with visualization descriptions\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b647024a95524b2e65c1468aca5270c7a9575890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/b647024a95524b2e65c1468aca5270c7a9575890"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/0ed5aea9336a9a2d4dfe951d705a6bf52dc7a57c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us