pilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/bc3fe36743cb184ff531dc56ac04f2ae454a154d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T16:36:38Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T16:36:38Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat: add appendix-b-languages interactive visualization project\n\nImplements Appendix B — Notes on Languages and Algorithms with:\n\n- BNF grammar explorer: editor, step-by-step derivation, string\n  generator (LCG-seeded), and recursive-descent parse tree builder\n- Pseudocode tokeniser: live syntax highlighting with AIMA keyword\n  classification, token inspector panel on hover\n- Quick-reference cards for all token types and BNF notation\n- 10 pure algorithm functions in src/algorithms/index.ts covering\n  parseBNF, isNonTerminal, getNonTerminals, getTerminals,\n  deriveOneStep, generateString, buildParseTree, tokenizePseudocode,\n  parsePseudocode, tracePseudocode\n- 77 tests achieving 100% branch + line coverage\n- TypeScript strict mode, no any, all functions pure/side-effect-free\n- Build output well within 500 KB gzipped limit\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"21a729f6929baac42915b9bb228cf06cbb8b4493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/21a729f6929baac42915b9bb228cf06cbb8b4493"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/bc3fe36743cb184ff531dc56ac04f2ae454a154d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified