apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/d7970ea8d595ef4778cb610e33cb87693f7346a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T16:25:11Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T16:25:11Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat: add appendix-a-math project for Mathematical Background (Appendix A)\n\nImplements the interactive visualization project for Appendix A — Mathematical\nBackground from AIMA 4th Ed., following the same structure as existing chapters.\n\n## What''s included\n\n### §A.1 Complexity Analysis\n- compareComplexities: compare all 8 classes at a given n\n- isBigOValid: verify f(n) ≤ c·g(n) for all n ≥ n0\n- findBigOConstants: find minimal c and n0 for a Big-O relationship\n\n### §A.2 Linear Algebra\n- addVectors, scaleVector, dotProduct\n- matMul: arbitrary m×k × k×n matrix multiplication\n- transpose: m×n → n×m\n- applyTransform: 2×2 matrix applied to 2D point\n- eigenvalues2x2: real and complex eigenvalues via characteristic polynomial\n\n### §A.3 Probability Distributions\n- gaussianPDF / gaussianCDF (Abramowitz & Stegun erf approximation)\n- uniformPDF / uniformCDF\n- bernoulliPMF, binomialPMF (log-space), poissonPMF (log-space)\n- exponentialPDF / exponentialCDF\n- betaPDF (log-space, with boundary cases), logGamma (Lanczos approximation)\n- sampleMean, sampleVariance (Bessel''s correction)\n\n## Testing\n- 113 tests, 100% branch + line coverage (vitest + v8)\n- All edge cases: n=0, empty arrays, boundary distributions, complex eigenvalues\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f94a934df7d5ccc37711107b719792094af807f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/7f94a934df7d5ccc37711107b719792094af807f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/d7970ea8d595ef4778cb610e33cb87693f7346a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/d7970ea8d595ef4778cb610e33cb87693f7346a4","node_id":"C_kwDORdo_b9oAKGQ3OTcwZWE4ZDU5NWVmNDc3OGNiNjEwZTMzY2I4NzY5M2Y3MzQ2YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/bb3b7d98006de1ebf30709e2dc0bf6f9d874ca85","sha":"bb3b7d98006de1ebf30709e2dc0bf6f9d874ca85","url