-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/3da5297d86878d6783b9f45295a5054af06822be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T14:55:22Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T14:55:22Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"Add CYKVisualizer component for Chapter 24\n\nImplements an interactive step-by-step CYK (Cocke-Younger-Kasami)\nprobabilistic chart parser visualizer using the E0 Wumpus-World PCFG.\n\nFeatures:\n- Sentence input with 5 preset sentences (including a no-parse example)\n- Play/Pause/Step/Reset controls with 1×/2×/4× playback speed\n- RAF-based animation respecting prefers-reduced-motion\n- n×n CYK chart table with active-cell highlighting and color-coded\n  symbol entries (S=green, NP=amber, VP=indigo, etc.)\n- Right-side state inspection panel (phase, span, split-k, rule, P)\n- SVG parse tree diagram with circular grammar nodes and word leaf rects\n- Collapsible E0 grammar display (phrase-structure + lexical rules)\n- KaTeX-rendered CYK recurrence formula in the header\n- Full ARIA labels and keyboard-navigable controls\n- TypeScript strict mode (no any, exactOptionalPropertyTypes)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2aab8073d94c2f83c6da30b4b2844d4d75389f2","url":"https://api.github.