ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/f03d3f831137c9741f9869c3bce9ddf2f4451b4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T04:14:37Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T04:14:37Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat(chapter-18): add 4 probabilistic programming visualization components\n\n- RPMVisualizer: step-through grounding of Relational Probability Model\n  (§18.1) with configurable customers/books, animated BN graph, and\n  world sampling with log-probability display\n- OUPMVisualizer: Open-Universe Probability Model world generation\n  (§18.2) with number statements, running probability table, and\n  dishonest-customer fake-ID detection\n- DataAssociationVisualizer: nearest-neighbor vs Hungarian algorithm\n  comparison (§18.3) for crossing-aircraft radar tracking with SVG\n  position-vs-time plot and assignment state panel\n- GenerativeProgramVisualizer: execution trace explorer + MCMC\n  Metropolis-Hastings inference (§18.4) with independent/Markov letter\n  models, log-likelihood chart, and best-trace display\n- Updated App.tsx to show all 4 sections with SectionHeader pattern\n\nAll components: RAF-based animation, prefers-reduced-motion, ARIA labels,\ninline styles only, TypeScript strict, no-any, mobile responsive.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8f0c2e773eca57a3f3c061f2cd62ab80abae723","url":"https://api.github.com/repo