//api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/23eb59b3997054d8fd223e9bb13ca550ce0a4dc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:43Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:55:43Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat(chapter-16): implement 5 interactive visualization components\n\nAdd complete visualization suite for Chapter 16 (Making Complex Decisions):\n\n- MDPGridWorldViz: 4×3 grid world colored by utility, policy arrows,\n  sliders for step reward r and discount γ, Bellman equation display,\n  hover state inspection panel\n- ValueIterationViz: animated iteration playback, SVG convergence\n  line chart for 4 selected states, γ slider\n- PolicyIterationViz: phase-colored background (evaluation=blue,\n  improvement=green), highlights changed cells, mini side-by-side\n  policy comparison panel\n- BanditSimulator: UCB1/Thompson Sampling toggle, arm mean sliders,\n  SVG bar chart (mean + UCB bonus), SVG cumulative regret chart\n- POMDPViz: 2-state A/B POMDP, SVG alpha-vector plot with upper\n  envelope, belief update demo, play-through-depths animation\n\nAll components use requestAnimationFrame with speed control,\nrespect prefers-reduced-motion, have ARIA labels, use KaTeX for\nmath, and follow the project design system. Build passes zero-error.\n\nUpdate manifest.json: set all 5 sections to ''complete''.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c6fb986a4e62b3ca3b6d8cd87ac0801bbb12c38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/4c6fb986a4e62b3ca3b6d8cd87ac0801bbb12c38"