]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:22:23Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat(chapter-12): implement Quantifying Uncertainty visualizations\n\n- Add 13 pure algorithm functions (§12.2-12.7): validateDistribution,\n  inclusionExclusion, complementRule, productRule, conditionalFromJoint,\n  marginalize, inferFromJoint, normalizeDistribution, checkIndependence,\n  bayesRule, bayesNormalized, naiveBayesClassify, wumpusPitProbability\n- 65 tests with 100% branch+line coverage on src/algorithms/\n- ProbabilityAxiomExplorer: §12.1-12.2 Kolmogorov axiom explorer with\n  real-time violation detection and Dutch Book warning\n- JointDistributionViz: §12.3 interactive Cavity/Toothache/Catch table\n  with live evidence conditioning and normalization step display\n- IndependenceExplorer: §12.4 Weather⊥Dental independence demo with\n  dependency slider\n- BayesRuleDemo: §12.5 animated 5-step meningitis example with\n  play/pause/speed controls and conditional independence verification\n- NaiveBayesDemo: §12.6 15-word text classifier across 4 categories\n  with animated bar chart\n- WumpusWorldViz: §12.7 interactive 4×4 grid with pit probability\n  heatmap, Book Example loader, and frontier enumeration\n- Update manifest.json: all 6 sections marked complete\n- Update README.md with visualization descriptions\n- Bundle: ~133 KB gzipped (well under 500 KB limit)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6af0f761517ad2ea938126c235ad99b5242d61ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/6af0f761517ad2ea938126c235ad99b5242d61ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/beaeb936335f093d4099762020354fda7731167b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/11433