organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/9f37de6e95880438d85e1bd7da605939d04fe7e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:19:38Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T03:19:38Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"feat(ch13): implement probabilistic reasoning algorithms\n\nImplement all Bayesian network inference algorithms for Chapter 13\n(Probabilistic Reasoning) of the AIMA visualizations project.\n\nData structures:\n- BayesNode, BayesNet, Assignment, Factor, VEStep\n- Canonical networks: BURGLARY_NET (Fig 13.2), SPRINKLER_NET (Fig 13.15)\n- Per-algorithm step types for visualization playback\n\nAlgorithms:\n- cptIndex / cptLookup / jointProbability — core CPT helpers\n- enumerationAsk (Fig 13.11) with full recursive step recording\n- makeFactor / pointwiseProduct / sumOut — factor operations\n- eliminationAsk (Fig 13.13) with VEStep recording\n- seededRandom (xorshift32) / sampleFromDistribution\n- priorSample, rejectionSampling, likelihoodWeighting\n- gibbsSampling (Fig 13.20) with Markov-blanket conditional\n- markovBlanket — parents + children + co-parents\n- noisyOR — CPT generation for noisy-OR models\n- doCalc — do-calculus / causal intervention (§13.5)\n\nTests (136 tests, 100% line/branch/function/statement coverage):\n- All exported functions tested with edge cases\n- Impossible evidence (total=0), single-node nets, certain events\n- Fixed-seed reproducibility checks for all sampling algorithms\n- Cross-algorithm consistency: enumeration ≡ VE on both networks\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8031317562cfc4d11a87f8bba724a3f2efa359d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/8031317562cfc4d11a87f8bba724a3f2efa359d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/9f37de6e95880438d85e1bd7da605939d04fe7e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/9f37de6e95880438d85e1bd7da605939d04fe7e1","node_id":"C_kwDORdo_b9oAKDlmMzdkZTZlOTU4ODA0MzhkODVlMWJkN2RhNjA1OTM5ZDA0ZmU3ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/23acca7ee88bcb71c1555104982a6d033242eb18","sha":"23acca7ee88bcb71c1555104982a6d033242eb18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/com