hub.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/4df63d874bac305e4c2fe7df5f5b170b3b215467/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:24:49Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:24:49Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"Chapter 10: Implement full React visualization suite for Knowledge Representation\n\nAdd 5 interactive visualizations covering AIMA §10.1–10.6:\n\n- OntologyViz: AIMA upper ontology tree (23 nodes), click-to-explore\n  ancestors via getAncestors, step-through inheritance query via\n  inheritProperty, what-if custom category insertion\n\n- EventCalculusViz: Allen''s 13 interval relations with interactive\n  draggable SVG bars + walkthrough animation; Shankar SF→DC→Berkeley\n  event calculus timeline with fluent tracking via eventCalcTrace\n\n- ModalLogicViz: Possible-worlds semantics for Lois/Superman/Clark Kent;\n  toggle accessibility relations, knowledge table, referential opacity\n  explanation with KaTeX notation\n\n- SemanticNetworkViz: SVG semantic network with step-through inheritance\n  query; DL CLASSIC classifier using dlClassify with concept builder and\n  individual property what-if control\n\n- DefaultReasoningViz: Nixon Diamond with two-extension display using\n  nixonDiamond(); default logic Tweety/Penguin step-through via\n  computeDefaultExtension; JTMS retraction demo via jtmsRetract\n\nAlso update App.tsx with sticky nav header and section anchors, and\nmanifest.json to mark all 5 sections as complete.\n\nBuild: 76.80 kB gzip (KaTeX), 43.05 kB main chunk — under 500 KB limit.\nCodeQL: 0 alerts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d0e5bcbb11022d89d59409dc843939b753391bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/2d0e5bcbb11022d89d59409dc843939b753391bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/4df63d874bac305e4c2fe7df5f5b170b3b215467","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/4df63d874bac305e4c2fe7df5f5b170b3b215467","node_id":"C_kwDORdo_b9oAKDRkZjYzZDg3NGJhYzMwNWU0YzJmZTdkZjVmNWIxNzBiM2IyMTU0Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/7947068ab30df449e981aa9b2a2c83ff6541d578","sha":"7947068ab30df449e981aa9b2a2c83ff6541d578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/7947068ab30df449e981aa9b2a2c83ff6541d578"}],"sha":"4df63d874bac305e4c2fe7df5f5b170b3b215467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/4df63d874bac305e4c2fe7df5f5b170b3b215467"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/a6025cf1a872924325a8dd5af7deb859c3018bcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:13:35Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:13:35Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"Chapter 27: implement Computer Vision algorithms with 100% test coverage\n\nAdd 14 pure algorithm functions to src/algorithms/index.ts:\n- rgbToGrayscale: ITU-R BT.601 luma formula with [0,255] clamping\n- gaussianKernel1D / gaussianKernel2D: normalised Gaussian kernels with\n  sigma<=0 unit-impulse fallback\n- applyConvolution2D: 2-D separable convolution with edge-clamping\n- sobelGradient: Sobel Kx/Ky operators yielding magnitude + direction\n- nonMaxSuppression1D: 4-orientation quantised NMS for edge thinning\n- applyThreshold: binary threshold producing 0/1 array\n- computeEdges: full Canny-style pipeline (smooth→Sobel→NMS→threshold)\n- ssdOpticalFlow: block-matching SSD dense optical flow; border pixels\n  whose source block is out-of-bounds return {dx:0, dy:0}\n- perspectiveProject: pinhole camera projection, null for z≤0\n- lambertShading: Lambertian diffuse shading with zero-vector safety\n- computeDepthFromDisparity: stereo triangulation, null for disparity≤0\n- iouBoundingBox: axis-aligned bounding box IoU\n- nmsBoxes: greedy NMS for object detection (O(n²))\n\n91 tests in tests/algorithms.test.ts covering all branches, including\nevery NMS orientation and OOB-neighbour ternary branch.\n\nAll 100% statement / branch / function / line coverage confirmed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"446dc09fe3c2fdf13a08da5bb790585051e5a888","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/446dc09fe3c2fdf13a08da5bb790585051e5a888"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/a6025cf1a872924325a8dd5af7deb859c3018bcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https:/