5257b","node_id":"C_kwDORdo_b9oAKDg5MDIyODg2NDUwOTJiNDNlNDI1MDc1OTBhMGE0MWRhOTZjNTI1N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/62a58a708f60f6dbe803d97d520e63e435f49923","sha":"62a58a708f60f6dbe803d97d520e63e435f49923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/62a58a708f60f6dbe803d97d520e63e435f49923"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commit/4418d2f37a39a053929ce900dcaa20b5dbf0e7e3","sha":"4418d2f37a39a053929ce900dcaa20b5dbf0e7e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/4418d2f37a39a053929ce900dcaa20b5dbf0e7e3"}],"sha":"8902288645092b43e42507590a0a41da96c5257b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/8902288645092b43e42507590a0a41da96c5257b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/commits/9f3dca65bacb7153bb58000f1c77a2a9c1ed3d1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T01:17:48Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T01:17:48Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"message":"chapter-07: add ttEntails, plResolution, walkSat, kbAgent algorithms\n\nAdd four new pure-function algorithm implementations to chapter-07:\n\n- ttEntails (§7.4): Truth-table entailment check (TT-ENTAILS algorithm).\n  Enumerates all 2^n variable assignments, checks every row where KB is\n  true for alpha truth; early-terminates on counter-example (''disproved''),\n  marks final step ''proved'' when entailment holds.\n\n- plResolution (§7.5): Resolution theorem proving (PL-RESOLUTION).\n  Proves KB |= alpha by deriving the empty clause from KB ∧ ¬alpha;\n  terminates ''disproved'' when no new clauses can be added. Uses\n  order-independent duplicate clause detection.\n\n- walkSat (§7.6): Randomized local-search SAT solver (WALKSAT).\n  Seeded LCG (a=1664525, c=1013904223, m=2^32) for full determinism.\n  Each step either greedily maximises satisfied clauses (prob 1-p) or\n  flips a random variable from the unsatisfied clause (prob p).\n\n- kbAgent (§7.1 Figure 7.1): Knowledge-based agent TELL/ASK loop.\n  Adds percept facts and immediate inferences to KB at each timestep,\n  then selects an action (Grab / MoveForward / TurnLeft).\n\nTests: 44 new tests added (56 → 100 total).\n100% statement, branch, function, and line coverage maintained.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e52659c24742e486fa1dc99fa81c81e7cea2537a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/trees/e52659c24742e486fa1dc99fa81c81e7cea2537a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsurrea/aima-visualizations/git/commits/9f3dca65bacb7153bb58000f1c77a2a9c1ed3d1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_ur