:"tr00x@proton.me","name":"Tim Hunt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T18:50:44Z","email":"tr00x@proton.me","name":"Tim Hunt"},"message":"Add Krisp noise cancellation, Jabra auto-select, faster responses\n\n- Enable Daily.co Krisp noise cancellation for lobby noise filtering\n- Auto-detect and select Jabra Speak 410 mic + speaker by device name\n- Set explicit WebRTC audio constraints (echo, noise, AGC)\n- Change participant_pause_sensitivity from low to high for faster replies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5774b17ce2076dbea0122de10ae7eb01bc3a0e55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tr00x/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/5774b17ce2076dbea0122de10ae7eb01bc3a0e55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tr00x/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/7802e0595704918b432dd620a1db6a6d0e4b39d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75398890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tr00x","id":75398890,"login":"tr00x","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1Mzk4ODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tr00x/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/commit/7802e0595704918b432dd620a1db6a6d0e4