ceptionist with conversational video avatar\n\nTavus CVI + Daily.co WebRTC + Open Dental integration.\nReal-time AI avatar for patient identity verification, appointments, and balances.\n\nFeatures:\n- Conversational AI video avatar (Jenny)\n- Fuzzy name matching (3-tier: exact, SOUNDEX, difflib)\n- Patient dashboard with appointments and balance\n- Multilingual support (EN/ES/RU)\n- Staff manual check-in sidebar\n- PWA installable fullscreen kiosk app\n- Inactivity guard + goodbye detection\n- Session hard cap + stale session reaper\n- HIPAA audit logging\n- Auto LAN IP detection for local deployment\n- PM2 process management","tree":{"sha":"9a55b70ef8aae4c437ea20471dc4d1a379f05fcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tr00x/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/trees/9a55b70ef8aae4c437ea20471dc4d1a379f05fcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tr00x/Kiosk-AI-Agent-Avatar-Tavus/git/commits/2e2c8b327d11375df213ebf29bd000810d084058","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75398890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tr00x","id":75398890,"login":"tr00x","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1Mzk4ODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tr00x","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tr00x/Kiosk-A