ter":{"date":"2025-11-19T13:14:00Z","email":"mbreizma@redhat.com","name":"Matan Breizman"},"message":"ceph.spec.in: Include Crimson by default in RPM builds\n\nWith #65782 merged, Crimson could be now built as part of the default RPM build flavor.\nThe binaries ceph-osd-crimson and ceph-osd-classic are managed via `update-alternatives`\nand selected based on priority:\n\n- ceph-osd-classic keeps the **highest** priority (100) and remains the default.\n- Switching to crimson is possible via:\n  update-alternatives --set ceph-osd /usr/bin/ceph-osd-crimson\n\nExisting classic behavior remains unchanged unless the above command is explicitly executed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Matan Breizman <mbreizma@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a03bb2ef3fc4de17fba5183b8858722877aa570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ByteShifted22/ceph/git/trees/3a03bb2ef3fc4de17fba5183b8858722877aa570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ByteShifted22/ceph/git/commits/08c334bcb7def11a86711ccf25d4471f2e7be14b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63903872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Matan-B","id":63903872,"login":"Matan-B","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTAzODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B","