 filter unowned tabs, ensuring safer reuse.\n- Enhanced error handling for tab connection processes, providing clearer feedback for invalid inputs.\n- Updated unit tests to cover new scenarios and validate the refined logic.","tree":{"sha":"19e17470ac114a56d0dcea3a1bfae8b8af282083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/19e17470ac114a56d0dcea3a1bfae8b8af282083"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/b252b7c65929dff39cf49e0baf764e930b644725","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/b252b7c65929dff39cf49e0baf764e930b644725","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKGIyNTJiN2M2NTkyOWRmZjM5Y2Y0OWUwYmFmNzY0ZTkzMGI2NDQ3MjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42","sha":"bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42"}],"sha":"b252b7c65929dff39cf49e0baf764e930b644725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/b252b7c65929dff39cf49e0baf764e930b644725"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T02:37:53Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T02:37:53Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"fix: tighten navigate timeout budgeting and diagnostics\n\nPrevent false timeout outcomes during navigate by binding CDP command timeout to remaining execute budget and removing fixed post-navigate sleep. Add timeout-classification tests and a detailed audit doc to verify behavior and troubleshooting steps.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"8d06ead6487080bdd3da82a9cdc82c3f2eb0540c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/8d06ead6487080bdd3da82a9cdc82c3f2eb0540c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKGJkOGRkYzk5OTYwYzJmZTU2ODNjYTVlOWU3ZmVmZjA4NDI2NjVmNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/1f0142efa80088ca637424f8189ae668bc44f497","sha":"1f0142efa80088ca637424f8189ae668bc44f497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/1f0142efa80088ca637424f8189ae668bc44f497"}],"sha":"bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/bd8ddc99960c2fe5683ca5e9e7feff0842665f42"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/1f0142efa80088ca637424f8189ae668bc44f497/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T05:23:23Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T05:23:23Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"fix: refine tab selection logic and error handling in relay system\n\n- Updated the tab matching logic to filter out owned tabs more effectively, ensuring that only unowned and safe tabs are considered for reuse.\n- Enhanced error handling in the tab connection process to provide clearer feedback when no valid URL or tabId is provided.\n- Improved unit tests to cover new scenarios, including random selection among safe tabs and handling of edge cases with owned tabs.\n- Adjusted existing tests to reflect changes in the tab selection criteria and ensure robust validation of the new logic.","tree":{"sha":"e902fcd903c5073042b57fba69355dbc0ef0e942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/e902fcd903c5073042b57fba69355d