:null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/1212ae2fb5605292c6935417f1b9b3a83f77b0de","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKDEyMTJhZTJmYjU2MDUyOTJjNjkzNTQxN2YxYjliM2E4M2Y3N2IwZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e","sha":"4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e"}],"sha":"1212ae2fb5605292c6935417f1b9b3a83f77b0de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/1212ae2fb5605292c6935417f1b9b3a83f77b0de"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T08:05:15Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T08:05:15Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"feat: enhance tab matching and reuse logic in relay system\n\n- Introduced functions to normalize URL hints and match tabs based on these hints, improving the accuracy of tab selection.\n- Implemented a scoring system for tab reuse to prioritize unowned and safe tabs, enhancing user experience by reducing unnecessary tab creation.\n- Added unit tests for new functionalities, ensuring robust behavior in various scenarios.\n- Updated existing tab handling logic to utilize the new matching and scoring mechanisms for better performance.","tree":{"sha":"080987ebe4845eb0d96af11ffd43a3b5cfd7902d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/080987ebe4845eb0d96af11ffd43a3b5cfd7902d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKDRmOGY4NTRkN2UyYmMwODFiYjA2ZTdkYzU4MjdjOTljNzI5MWFlM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc","sha":"333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc"}],"sha":"4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/4f8f854d7e2bc081bb06e7dc5827c99c7291ae3e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T09:02:14Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T09:02:14Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"feat: implement safe auto-claiming of new tab pages in relay system\n\n- Introduced a mechanism to auto-claim only safe tabs (e.g., about:blank, chrome://newtab/) to prevent hijacking active user sessions.\n- Updated the fallback logic in the tab creation process to check for safe URLs before claiming unowned tabs.\n- Added unit tests for the new safe auto-claim functionality, ensuring correct behavior for various tab scenarios.\n- Enhanced error handling and logging for better traceability during tab claiming operations.","tree":{"sha":"a53aee83337e036ecd70b2cd75cf53a1ae3e5929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/a53aee83337e036ecd70b2cd75cf53a1ae3e5929"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKDMzM2ZiNTI3NTE3Y2FiMzQwYWI3MTQxY2M2YmMzZDgxNGRiMGRmZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/ee1e10272e4e902d29fbd1ea062ff4c83fa11e09","sha":"ee1e10272e4e902d29fbd1ea062ff4c83fa11e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/ee1e10272e4e902d29fbd1ea062ff4c83fa11e09"}],"sha":"333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/333fb527517cab340ab7141cc6bc3d814db0dfdc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/ee1e10272e4e902d29fbd1ea062ff4c83fa11e09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:38:01Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T08:38:01Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"fix: prevent infinite page refresh after single-spa override in extension panel\n\nRoot cause: detectExternalChanges polling useEffect had savedOverrides in\nits dependency array. Every toggle/save triggered useEffect re-setup with\nan immediate poll that read stale page state, flipping savedOverrides back,\ncreating a flip-flop infinite-reload cycle.\n\nFix:\n- Add internalOpActiveRef + cooldownUntilRef to suppress polling during\n  internal operations and 8s cooldown period\n- Use savedOverridesRef instead of savedOverrides in polling dependency\n  array to prevent effect re-mounting on state changes\n- Remove immediate detectExternalChanges() call on effect setup; rely\n  solely on setInterval\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"64fd5411637154e9095b5141de48cfae572972be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/64fd5411637154e9095b5141de48cfae572972be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/ee1e10272e4e902d29fbd1ea062ff4c83fa11e09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/ee1e10272e4e902d29fbd1ea062ff4c83fa11e09","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKGVlMWUxMDI3