/node_modules/ to ../node_modules/ for hoisting\n- Add engines: { node: \">=18\" }\n- Remove sub-package lock files (workspace uses root lock only)\n- Add CLONE_AND_USE_AUDIT.md documenting build chain and troubleshooting\n- Fully update README with new Quick Start, Scripts table, and architecture\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"07e941d7615386abe61211cefa2a8d5a849872b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/07e941d7615386abe61211cefa2a8d5a849872b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/f60586b8be61bbdef6bea18ebebec825a7b10f46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/f60586b8be61bbdef6bea18ebebec825a7b10f46","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKGY2MDU4NmI4YmU2MWJiZGVmNmJlYTE4ZWJlYmVjODI1YTdiMTBmNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678","sha":"cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678"}],"sha":"f60586b8be61bbdef6bea18ebebec825a7b10f46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/f60586b8be61bbdef6bea18ebebec825a7b10f46"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T11:26:16Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T11:26:16Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"docs: streamline README with Quick Start, fix missing tools, add troubleshooting\n\n- Move build instructions to the top as first section users see\n- Consolidate 30 MCP tools into categorized table (added interact, browser_fetch, trace)\n- Fix inaccurate descriptions (ensure_fresh_render, root dist/cli.js entry point)\n- Add troubleshooting for common clone-and-use issues (manifest missing, module not found, npm mirror)\n- Regenerate package-lock.json files to fix stale Tencent mirror URLs\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"1a626550528aba35c5298b45982ddd35353686c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/1a626550528aba35c5298b45982ddd35353686c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/commits/cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678","node_id":"C_kwDORd3Jv9oAKGNmNzAxYmQ3ODIzNGZiN2Q5ZjVkZGNkOGFkMDhjYzc5YmJjMjk2Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/leonbuild/spawriter/commit/a80dcdec48621f2618109c8ca1f9f249db8d0292","sha":"a80dcdec48621f2618109c8ca1f9f249db8d0292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/a80dcdec48621f2618109c8ca1f9f249db8d0292"}],"sha":"cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/cf701bd78234fb7d9f5ddcd8ad08cc79bbc29678"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/commits/a80dcdec48621f2618109c8ca1f9f249db8d0292/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T11:23:48Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T11:23:48Z","email":"zlguo@cnic.cn","name":"mimas"},"message":"feat(ext): include site hostname in exported override filename\n\nExport filename now includes the inspected page''s hostname, e.g.\n\"single-spa-overrides_journal.cstspace.cn.json\" instead of generic\n\"exported single-spa overrides.json\". Falls back to no suffix if\nhostname can''t be retrieved.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"b4b3c73e2845271c4c1b2974e56e02246a6a05a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leonbuild/spawriter/git/trees/b4b3c73e2845271c4c1b2