de747a75a8f585/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T20:37:11Z","email":"jrequena9@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Requena Pérez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T20:37:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(combobox): add tags mode with selection animations (#48)\n\nAdd an opt-in `tags` boolean to `<reke-combobox multiple>` that renders\nselected values as dismissible chips inside the input control, with a\nscale-in animation on add. Selection on a dropdown option now flashes\nthe row briefly. Selected options are also hidden from the list to\navoid duplicates.\n\n- reke-combobox: `tags` prop, chip rendering, Backspace removes the\n  visually last chip, `filteredOptions` excludes selected values when\n  tags mode is on; refactored layout so the .control is the bordered\n  field in tags mode (input is borderless inside it); selected-label\n  summary renders as inline text instead of placeholder text.\n- reke-chip: named `prefix` slot (framework-agnostic) and a\n  `dismissLabel` (\"dismiss-label\") property forwarded to the inner\n  dismiss button so a screen reader announces \"Remove {label}\".\n- tokens: `--reke-animation-flash` (250 ms), `--reke-animation-scale-in`\n  (200 ms), `--reke-chip-prefix-size` (16 px).\n- `reduced-motion` media query disables animations.","tree":{"sha":"0970c2dde33f601873e2f4a90849f6e9ff9a78f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JReque/reke-ui/git/trees/0970c2dde33f601873e2f4a90849f6e9ff9a78f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JReque/reke-ui/git/commits/cb1a41a92947d66bbe700c9989de747a75a8f585","verification":{"payload":"tree 0970c2dde33f601873e2f4a90849f6e9ff9a78f6\nparent bba2b09b4139e4f7657d15654d66524cff4fbc1e\nauthor Jesús Requena Pérez <jrequena9@gmail.com> 1785011831 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785011831 +0200\n\nfeat(combobox): add tags mode with selection animations (#48)\n\nAdd an opt-in `tags` boolean to `<reke-combobox multiple>` that renders\nselected values as dismissible chips inside the input control, with a\nscale-in animation on add. Selection on a dropdown option now flashes\nthe row briefly. Selected options are also hidden from the list to\navoid duplicates.\n\n- reke-combobox: `tags` prop, chip rendering, Backspace removes the\n  visually last chip, `filteredOptions` excludes selected values when\n  tags mode is on; refactored layout so the .control is the bordered\n  field in tags mode (input is borderless inside it); selected-label\n  summary renders as inline text instead of placeholder text.\n- reke-chip: named `prefix` slot (framework-agnostic) and a\n  `dismissLabel` (\"dismiss-label\") property forwarded to the inner\n  dismiss button so a screen reader announces \"Remove {label}\".\n- tokens: `--reke-animation-flash` (250 ms), `--reke-animation-scale-in`\n  (200 ms), `--reke-chip-prefix-size` (16 px).\n- `reduced-motion` media query disables animations.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZR53CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAysQAFE2op4JlQ7nK2YF9RDw3Y2b\nDTLZME3y6fLACuSKcQec0jnO4N/JShLyqz9YPwuzaotYzHiqVJdltsPDmjwh9X0D\nTDnHHexhBg4wUl0WiDLdgAJ/+qIqU0J++59kbTxeaMloaO6pIAgXPSVQSmPiCz8W\nsG3GaOXH/ADBrLsKgJAqglKqLYZj3wAUCcJ3tSaI6C8Ee4YPS3riL6M72qE1hrsP\n1a5OyXkW7Ozk+1OlGFcHtJNOXRi/UoZtSkaK/R5MZNI4q4Kxkv7WT36f7WIC7c0D\nMuE3GYogwqRMbFdjbADw8eY661gYZJC38OfK0oKSgQsLk4Cqfr1WCc0J2Qrv6HVO\nnj2dsivAoLc2M1RZYA1bcluXrfHnzWcrBRYUt3lg00IF1uQQNHAm0aKhqSIhNpVZ\nGoCvQvLtl2mbmqu56WNvuFWXxtbJ7q4RU5WyS3tRF7sp419oEcbQrFzPU9Ord1Gm\ncgHzdrszjsnjFnSE3XLa4AqE3pBqZ5KlWOT0QQJPcCE7PxeNKuWDuqqg9GCfbA8W\npnOmQ3qwDTVMMS0SUHeTGBqGKfPzdjuxx1gNoC5jGTAlosFIZ2gZ+WC+qsrDxlDk\nPrxXrrdLUgwhIRorwv69cbPsgUuVEI8K4f4JSI9bHKWMhaLKrulYhIjdJGYI7vtG\nQcUDWP4D+mCOxj58q+sh\n=gx5g\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T20:37:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followe