https://api.github.com/users/JReque/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JReque/reke-ui/commits/bba2b09b4139e4f7657d15654d66524cff4fbc1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T20:32:55Z","email":"jrequena9@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Requena Pérez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T20:32:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(table): stop flushSync storm and prevent focus-steal scroll jumps (#47)\n\n* fix(react-table): stop flushSync warning storm on expanded rows\n\n* fix(table): prevent focus-steal scroll jumps from click targets\n\nThe table container inherited delegatesFocus: true from RekeElement, making\nany click in the host shadow scroll the first focusable descendant into\nview. For a table, that reads as the page jumping to the top row.\n\n- reke-table: disable shadow root focus delegation (containers should\n  not redirect focus or scroll).\n- react-bridge: cache the raw DOM node returned by a column renderer\n  while the row reference is unchanged, so Lit does not recreate a\n  focusable cell on unrelated re-renders.\n\n* style(table): trim verbose comments\n\nReplace narrative/debug-history comments in the focus delegation and\nflushSync fixes with one-line intent comments. The deprecation story\nbelongs in the commit message and PR body, not on every line.","tree":{"sha":"a59e612abb5d66d7008aed55ee0e76eb93fbe29a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JReque/reke-ui/git/trees/a59e612abb5d66d7008aed55ee0e76eb93fbe29a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JReque/reke-ui/git/commits/bba2b09b4139e4f7657d15654d66524cff4fbc1e","verification":{"payload":"tree a59e612abb5d66d7008aed55ee0e76eb93fbe29a\nparent efce66dd7d28a5d6dee8b222f7164f72ee08fbd6\nauthor Jesús Requena Pérez <jrequena9@gmail.com> 1785011575 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785011575 +0200\n\nfix(table): stop flushSync storm and prevent focus-steal scroll jumps (#47)\n\n* fix(react-table): stop flushSync warning storm on expanded rows\n\n* fix(table): prevent focus-steal scroll jumps from click targets\n\nThe table container inherited delegatesFocus: true from RekeElement, making\nany click in the host shadow scroll the first focusable descendant into\nview. For a table, that reads as the page jumping to the top row.\n\n- reke-table: disable shadow root focus delegation (containers should\n  not redirect focus or scroll).\n- react-bridge: cache the raw DOM node returned by a column renderer\n  while the row reference is unchanged, so Lit does not recreate a\n  focusable cell on unrelated re-renders.\n\n* style(table): trim verbose comments\n\nReplace narrative/debug-history comments in the focus delegation and\nflushSync fixes with one-line intent comments. The deprecation story\nbelongs in the commit message and PR body, not on every line.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZR13CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEDIQAJViekACFTZobeojCx7HWY6t\nG7e/f3l0FnWNODtA3aluTbJ48ZULa2WMdceVx+2wzGzWvjdSJAUQMS/EjqfRU/VW\n1ykg0ApLGwqZX8OGRnTy+4xxq/cN8sjQAx9YtJq/raSvkFTWySIpVhNfVkklAcqf\nC5lcN8wTjT50nYqXY7qXiqO5ZOBTMFPya/5Ka3mZxc9AzMCw2ao427FiE0buI3Sm\ngNas+Bt8mWXfu320SfmBzZTmUu7HC80oPe5lfrohTdqQcEQFgnMeclt2O1mN3TkP\nEiS0mj54kg5Es4qRdlyr9DNG1X9DgP6xS4D82/a1yKcp+Tq/e5QO7ALj6UR7Zs6G\nqtXXN905sNgMqoXvyeNVsmMTnFKeXLTCa9XICRxXjlrgYmE/sVV1X3y1UzoSd5/E\nHQGEaiUf0PzXVTh5EkQsxqGtok04ProczzKbI+l1V9iSRBK/FBjJJp0o8R7XbD+9\nFzDqRb2YlLgOQFDeRj078gESwVAAWz+LDxq5ajw6h2RX8zu2RSs9fCk48XSbikkc\nUKHvSWdgka7DW3MuZWsyJuvLoXxLMUINAqz0YyPQTVgN9khp15SA3Q9IXxoG1EIC\nn/hwu+HbcJa5LS4u8X01XQF1ImbYXVpkNEolqrSk6OEFyNhpzz9bVpJAASZ9gmPu\nUwdUMyCzAwOG3mAlOH/Z\n=Qzqc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T20:32:56Z"}},"comm