owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JReque","id":18365190,"login":"JReque","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzY1MTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JReque","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JReque/reke-ui/commits/6013ec959b048f6e061918765ef1ca80f0e4d485/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T04:47:54Z","email":"jrequena9@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Requena"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T04:47:54Z","email":"jrequena9@gmail.com","name":"Jesus Requena"},"message":"chore(ci): adopt Biome (lint + format) and enforce coverage thresholds\n\n- Add Biome 2.5 for linting + formatting, configured to match the existing\n  style (single quotes, 2-space indent) to minimize churn. Overrides:\n  disable React-hook rules for src/react-bridge (false positives on the\n  generic forwardRef pattern + intentional manual deps), and\n  noShadowRestrictedNames for *.stories.ts (Storybook story names like\n  `Error` are intentional exports). noNonNullAssertion off globally (the\n  codebase uses `!` idiomatically).\n- One-time biome format across src.\n- Add v8 coverage with thresholds: lines/statements/functions 80%,\n  branches 70% (current: ~89/87/90/74).\n- CI now runs `biome ci` + tsc + build + coverage on every PR, so failing\n  lint/tests/coverage block the merge.\n\nFix: remove a dead `? false : false` ternary in reke-date-range.","tree":{"sha":"32da57b3c9b98e0240697ab0e174f61dc178eca1","url":"htt