s://api.github.com/users/codedbykishore/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedbykishore","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/commits/42161553411a65dc5c704138c445c9735239a9b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T12:07:35Z","email":"kishore3014b@gmail.com","name":"Kishore B"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T12:07:35Z","email":"kishore3014b@gmail.com","name":"Kishore B"},"message":"feat(m2.5): build LaTeX resume editor with AI chat and live preview\n\nImplements the full M2.5 milestone — a two-column resume editor:\n\nLayout\n- Left panel: AI chat (permanent, resizable via react-resizable-panels)\n- Right panel: Code / Preview toggle (Monaco editor + PDF viewer)\n- SSR-safe mounted guard to prevent react-resizable-panels hydration\nmismatch\n\nCompile\n- On-demand and auto-compile (on by default) via /resumes/{id}/compile\n- PDF served via S3 presigned URL (fixed: was storing local path as S3\nkey)\n- Fixed response model mismatch (CompileOnDemandResponse, not\nCompilationResponse)\n\nAI edit streaming\n- SSE stream from /resumes/{id}/ai-edit using AWS Bedrock\n- Backend event_stream() rewritten with emitted_up_to cursor + 7-char\n  holdback buffer so partial <latex> tag fragments never reach the\nclient\n- Frontend consumer simplified: no inLatexBlock guard needed\n\nDiff view\n- Custom LCS-based line differ (no external deps)\n- Hunk-only display with ±3 context lines\n- Accept / Reject buttons to apply or discard AI-proposed LaTeX","tree":{"sha":"622feb971f06fadaf4f411f56d2ebc9cfe51b504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/trees/622feb971f06fadaf4f411f56d2ebc9cfe51b504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/commits/42161553411a65dc5c704138c445c9735239a9b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 622feb971f06fadaf4f411f56d2ebc9cfe51b504\nparent 2066d6a4647ef077e7d347d49056c062483438b9\nauthor Kishore B <kishore3014b@gmail.com> 1772885255 +0530\ncommitter Kishore B <kishore3014b@gmail.com> 1772885255 +0530\n\nfeat(m2.5): build LaTeX resume editor with AI chat and live preview\n\nImplements the full M2.5 milestone — a two-column resume editor:\n\nLayout\n- Left panel: AI chat (permanent, resizable via react-resizable-panels)\n- Right panel: Code / Preview toggle (Monaco editor + PDF viewer)\n- SSR-safe mounted guard to prevent react-resizable-panels hydration\nmismatch\n\nCompile\n- On-demand and auto-compile (on by default) via /resumes/{id}/compile\n- PDF served via S3 presigned URL (fixed: was storing local path as S3\nkey)\n- Fixed response model mismatch (CompileOnDemandResponse, not\nCompilationResponse)\n\nAI edit streaming\n- SSE stream from /resumes/{id}/ai-edit using AWS Bedrock\n- Backend event_stream() rewritten with emitted_up_to cursor + 7-char\n  holdback buffer so partial <latex> tag fragments never reach the\nclient\n- Frontend consumer simplified: no inLatexBlock guard needed\n\nDiff view\n- Custom LCS-based line differ (no external deps)\n- Hunk-only display with ±3 context lines\n- Accept / Reject buttons to apply or discard AI-proposed LaTeX\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgGrWt1vXqzUC5mfMTbb4z9AO6ct\nX4IaoKT4M1DdtHCokAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAu0eH5ZxaXnqlhwcrDKaKgLyt2XskeIFEiY07pH0V2UCrS45kt3+GMdFzmaCnW9qE\nAEUAwMDt5h4lMBOPSxhw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T12:08:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147139122?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedbykishore/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedbykishore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedbykishore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codedbykishore/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"ht