- Rewrite job_scraper.py with multi-query support, management role filter,\n  MD5 URL dedup, salary regex extraction, and scrape_all_queries()\n- Add UserJobStatuses and BlacklistedCompanies DynamoDB tables via\n  ensure_job_scout_tables() on startup\n- Add role property and require_admin dependency to deps.py\n- Wire scheduler start/stop and table creation into FastAPI lifespan\n- Add new jobs API endpoints: GET /scheduler/status, POST /scout/{id}/track,\n  GET /tracking, GET /blacklist, POST /blacklist, DELETE /blacklist/{name}\n- Rewrite job-scout-shell.tsx: stats cards with countdown timer, category\n  filter pills (localStorage-persisted), paginated jobs table (25/page)\n- Add tracking status dropdown defaulting to pending, formatPostedDate()\n  with ordinal suffix (e.g. 7th March 14:00), fixed-width title column,\n  and disabled Tailored Resume button (coming in M5)\n- Update api.ts with SchedulerStatus, TrackingStatuses, BlacklistedCompany\n  interfaces and full jobMatchApi rewrite (removed manual scan endpoint)\n- Add APScheduler>=3.10 to requirements.txt","tree":{"sha":"96535ac009529c804b290c91bca6d6fe047d5cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/trees/96535ac009529c804b290c91bca6d6fe047d5cac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/commits/5dde6cc88c4496bd44d8969ee5624d46e349ed06","verification":{"payload":"tree 96535ac009529c804b290c91bca6d6fe047d5cac\nparent 90741252a3fca63b8f14bd9bd5e5c7092e4d6fce\nauthor Gautham Krishna <heyitsgautham@gmail.com> 1772876023 +0530\ncommitter Gautham Krishna <heyitsgautham@gmail.com> 1772876023 +0530\n\nfeat(job-scout): add hourly cron scraper and dashboard UI\n\n- Add APScheduler-based hourly cron scraper running 12 search queries on\n  LinkedIn/Indeed; jobs are shared (no userId), first run after 10s delay\n- Rewrite job_scraper.py with multi-query support, management role filter,\n  MD5 URL dedup, salary regex extraction, and scrape_all_queries()\n- Add UserJobStatuses and BlacklistedCompanies DynamoDB tables via\n  ensure_job_scout_tables() on startup\n- Add role property and require_admin dependency to deps.py\n- Wire scheduler start/stop and table creation into FastAPI lifespan\n- Add new jobs API endpoints: GET /scheduler/status, POST /scout/{id}/track,\n  GET /tracking, GET /blacklist, POST /blacklist, DELETE /blacklist/{name}\n- Rewrite job-scout-shell.tsx: stats cards with countdown timer, category\n  filter pills (localStorage-persisted), paginated jobs table (25/page)\n- Add tracking status dropdown defaulting to pending, formatPostedDate()\n  with ordinal suffix (e.g. 7th March 14:00), fixed-width title column,\n  and disabled Tailored Resume button (coming in M5)\n- Update api.ts with SchedulerStatus, TrackingStatuses, BlacklistedCompany\n  interfaces and full jobMatchApi rewrite (removed manual scan endpoint)\n- Add APScheduler>=3.10 to requirements.txt\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEENsD+4s98PGrBpAmqZ937c8UrLlIFAmmr8PcACgkQZ937c8Ur\nLlLNQg/7BE/cLUb3RQwHcUswixVhEDyOAew8RY0QIUjxLUDNZ397Z+f7NOb0naXm\nusoZuXpDrkmWzYL7PbYOE386HiSdfC+f6HE1S8Gl5fL4DhTjqTyBndot8GPSZewd\nV8O6Yk97zcJ1JMl6ygoJfKViezbsmARqV76dJg6GbGKJCpfOoMcd9uq9BV1MAhzC\nCycZA6u8tJ3wAyZbK/bXC2BUM3GvBu14RheQv1u4u3jDaEUejcJMeQSeP3WMD1tP\nZJcteIybj6TPdMgfLHkB337sgqRddoFpNvShklUZ10c4Ism0ssFumRwM5Ziv4Nzb\nTTu+bUIha9GiE0ry21k87Vv/8zgXrZAgR5PrZ5/XOQfDNxa3RYa5BGSqHLBBwN4n\nqxcmJPXi5aXX+g7STmgsdRo1chCS7uXdUXScr6DBP/3elUtI3b9IAfKuNwrK6pp/\n2QpJ0Q0b9mD1FXqbUAofAvfhOIZ09rSETQSfubmtJYw+ABuje9xLgbSAye+VSMpu\nKc2QZxTaSqISZs9v8hu+Y1X/WvDuJSi4ypxTrubWLNUIPurXudWzlnSUt/VN+PGo\nfbnAxRMuBWHz1U3KDZ+LI17lUjlXUD+m8H2NfF4s324gru9MbUkG+eHdtiuAGBJo\nfgo18XHRV4vNmYV9hyzadglWRTjGWvTBE8HcFQZssEfdoOW35hw=\n=cnkV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T09:42:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146015011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsgautham/e