ore B"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T20:38:16Z","email":"kishore3014b@gmail.com","name":"Kishore B"},"message":"feat(backend): add job scraping, JD analysis, and match scoring services\n\n- job_scraper.py: jobspy-based multi-source job scraper (Indeed, LinkedIn,\n  Glassdoor) with filtering, dedup, and DynamoDB persistence\n- jd_analyzer.py: Gemini-powered JD parser extracting skills, requirements,\n  and structured metadata from raw job postings\n- match_scorer.py: resume-to-JD cosine similarity scorer using embedding\n  vectors with weighted section breakdowns\n- Add python-jobspy>=1.1.80 to requirements","tree":{"sha":"ee85cad65e17f9fd269a6e8f4626f292fb4bfa53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/trees/ee85cad65e17f9fd269a6e8f4626f292fb4bfa53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/commits/60bbca4babcd0b2e54b085ad874b21cbe1e301bf","verification":{"payload":"tree ee85cad65e17f9fd269a6e8f4626f292fb4bfa53\nparent 6096c1c7e8042b5feafde86d1344ca5fd33593eb\nauthor Kishore B <kishore3014b@gmail.com> 1772829496 +0530\ncommitter Kishore B <kishore3014b@gmail.com> 1772829496 +0530\n\nfeat(backend): add job scraping, JD analysis, and match scoring services\n\n- job_scraper.py: jobspy-based multi-source job scraper (Indeed, LinkedIn,\n  Glassdoor) with filtering, dedup, and DynamoDB persistence\n- jd_analyzer.py: Gemini-powered JD parser extracting skills, requirements,\n  and structured metadata from raw job postings\n- match_scorer.py: resume-to-JD cosine similarity scorer using embedding\n  vectors with weighted section breakdowns\n- Add python-jobspy>=1.1.80 to requirements\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgGrWt1vXqzUC5mfMTbb4z9AO6ct\nX4IaoKT4M1DdtHCokAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIMKHkOY8RtFVV0KtyU3P7Mqszn8AfYQF3lKiscfY3KCmKy8rx7N+k0SQBVTMQYx1u\nOJFMlEL68xEvsJeNp46gc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATU