 Add list_objects() and download_file() to S3Service for summary retrieval\n- Overhaul resumes-list.tsx: generator modal with JD input, live polling,\n  history list with status badges, inline PDF preview, .tex download\n- Fix downloadTex ReferenceError: moved function into ResumeGenerator component\n- Add M2 milestone completion report","tree":{"sha":"e4055d64109d576a7af3d424d261150802d32b09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/trees/e4055d64109d576a7af3d424d261150802d32b09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/commits/3047aee0639efce859875559a5a9d65f854d62aa","verification":{"payload":"tree e4055d64109d576a7af3d424d261150802d32b09\nparent fd81d376cf43a114d41e763afa89b20fb69a62bd\nauthor Gautham Krishna <heyitsgautham@gmail.com> 1772829161 +0530\ncommitter Gautham Krishna <heyitsgautham@gmail.com> 1772829244 +0530\n\nfeat(resume): implement M2 resume generator with JSON-to-template pipeline\n\n- Replace freeform LaTeX generation and sanitizer with JSON-to-template approach:\n  Claude outputs structured JSON, Python fills Jakes fixed LaTeX template,\n  eliminating the entire class of structural LaTeX errors\n- Add RESUME_JSON_PROMPT: instructs Claude to produce a resume_json block with\n  header, education, experience, projects, skills, achievements (plain text only)\n- Add JAKES_PREAMBLE: fixed 78-line LaTeX preamble constant, never AI-generated\n- Add _escape_latex(): escapes special chars in all text values before template fill\n- Add section builders: _build_header, _build_education, _build_experience,\n  _build_projects, _build_skills, _build_achievements, _fill_jakes_template\n- Add M2 API routes: POST /generate, GET /{id}/pdf, GET /{id}/tex,\n  GET /history, DELETE /{id} with M2GenerateRequest/Response models\n- Add list_objects() and download_file() to S3Service for summary retrieval\n- Overhaul resumes-list.tsx: generator modal with JD input, live polling,\n  history list with status badges, inli