"},"message":"refactor(projects): migrate backend to DynamoDB and add sync UI to projects list\n\n- Replace all SQLAlchemy queries in projects.py with dynamo_service\ncalls\n- Add _dynamo_to_response() helper to normalise DynamoDB items to\nfrontend shape\n- Switch get_current_user → get_current_user_dynamo across all project\nroutes\n- Add GitHub bulk-sync state, polling loop, and Sync All button to\nProjectsList\n- Fix profile-view polling to only resume when status is in_progress,\nnot pending\n- Simplify handleIngest to always delegate to startPolling after trigger\n- Add externalRefreshKey prop to ProfileView for parent-driven refresh\n- Add *.tsbuildinfo to .gitignore","tree":{"sha":"e65d092ba7b18481d3222963a327a66c07ec9593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/trees/e65d092ba7b18481d3222963a327a66c07ec9593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heyitsgautham/career-forge/git/commits/6096c1c7e8042b5feafde86d1344ca5fd33593eb","verification":{"payload":"tree e65d092ba7b18481d3222963a327a66c07ec9593\nparent 645744693f12d0a60afdcb06bf438babf29e6345\nauthor Kishore B <kishore3014b@gmail.com> 1772795134 +0530\ncommitter Kishore B <kishore3014b@gmail.com> 1772795134 +0530\n\nrefactor(projects): migrate backend to DynamoDB and add sync UI to projects list\n\n- Replace all SQLAlchemy queries in projects.py with dynamo_service\ncalls\n- Add _dynamo_to_response() helper to normalise DynamoDB items to\nfrontend shape\n- Switch get_current_user → get_current_user_dynamo across all project\nroutes\n- Add GitHub bulk-sync state, polling loop, and Sync All button to\nProjectsList\n- Fix profile-view polling to only resume when status is in_progress,\nnot pending\n- Simplify handleIngest to always delegate to startPolling after trigger\n- Add externalRefreshKey prop to ProfileView for parent-driven refresh\n- Add *.tsbuildinfo to .gitignore\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgG