Z","committedDate":"2026-09-18T20:52:46Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:03:16.966Z","repositoryId":1172472166,"sha":"27bdfb1e9c670004996b4d269fcf72bedc69afa5"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:03:16.966Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c2adacadc372e1bc4dba9201e03151a9c182e875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:45:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:45:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): the pt-BR set — an instance operated in Brazilian Portuguese\n\ntemplates/pt-BR/: the four templates, the three partials (with the\ninstruction that agents work, write and reply in Portuguese), the fourteen\nscaffold files and the strings catalogue.\n\nKept in English where tooling reads the label: `**Name:**` / `**Type:**` in\nIDENTITY.md and the first word of the four QUEUE.md section headings (each\nglossed in Portuguese), plus YAML keys and enum values.\n\ntests/clone-locale.test.mjs (14 tests) pins the Portuguese output, the\nabsence of English scaffold text and of unrendered tags, the recorded\nlanguage, the fallbacks, what ships, and that the cloned instance passes\ngenerate:schemas, validate:structure, validate:schemas and the instance\ndoctor with no blocker but git-remote-absent. Suite and fixture are\nexcluded from clones. docs/SETUP-PATHS.md documents the option.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b379d25d25979c9d4170ee31fa9e59257d95bb7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/b379d25d25979c9d4170ee31fa9e59257d95bb7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/c2adacadc372e1bc4dba9201e03151a9c182e875","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/c2adacadc372e1bc4dba9201e03151a9c182e875","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGMyYWRhY2FkYzM3MmUxYmM0ZGJhOTIwMWUwMzE1MWE5YzE4MmU4NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789","sha":"10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789"}],"sha":"c2adacadc372e1bc4dba9201e03151a9c182e875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c2adacadc372e1bc4dba9201e03151a9c182e875"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:45:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:45:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): clone-framework looks up what it writes by language\n\nAn optional `org.language` in the clone config (BCP-47, default `en`). Every\ntemplate, partial, scaffold file and short string is read as\ntemplates/<lang>/<file> when the framework has it and the English\ntemplates/<file> otherwise, from HEAD like any other template.\n\n- The placeholder and scaffold text stages 4, 4b and 6e wrote from inline\n  strings moves to templates/scaffold/ (mirroring the instance root) and\n  templates/strings.yaml. English output is byte-identical: a clone of both\n  fixtures before and after differs only in the framework files edited here.\n- The language is recorded as federation.yaml identity.language (added to\n  schemas/federation.yaml) and CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md include the `language`\n  partial. English writes neither.\n- A well-formed tag with no templates: English files and a logged note, the\n  language still recorded and agents told in English. Not a tag: ignored\n  with a note; the value never reaches a path.\n- An instance carries the English base and its own language''s set only\n  (isOtherLanguageTemplate in clone-excludes).\n- tests/clone-manifest.txt regenerated: +16 paths, the English scaffold\n  files, strings.yaml and the language partial. clone-framework.mjs ships\n  in every instance and now reads them.\n- initialize.mjs finds the SOUL.md mission under \"Missão\" as well.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58c0b063de44518a99022df2601ec8c3680c417e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/58c0b063de44518a99022df2601ec8c3680c417e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDEwYzlmMDE3MDkxODIyNTAzNTA1NjFjZGFmMTI4YWQ2YjRjMTM3ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7","sha":"0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7"}],"sha":"10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/10c9f01709182250350561cdaf128ad6b4c13789"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:32:20Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:32:20Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"Merge remote-tracking branch ''origin/main'' into feat/kms-two-plane-gate","tree":{"sha":"4f64b325aacc754ab452c123465717492baf5cc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/4f64b325aacc754ab452c123465717492baf5cc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDBkYmFjYjdlYWY5YWY1ZDVhZDM5YjczMWRlMGVkYzkxMDE0OTdmYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d","sha":"0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/d9f637e02b21554aba694478620d5c062fbbd04d","sha":"d9f637e02b21554aba694478620d5c062fbbd04d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/d9f637e02b21554aba694478620d5c062fbbd04d"}],"sha":"0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/0dbacb7eaf9af5d5ad39b731de0edc9101497fa7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:29:46Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:30:33Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(kms): each plane knows what it is — a canon never publishes, a public plane re-gates against its canon first and takes no ingest\n\nAT Proto publish applied only the framework floor and did not know where it was\nrunning: both existing commons were safe only because an operator ran it inside the\nexported repository. Now a canon (planes.public) refuses publish in every mode,\nbefore anything is listed, minted or written; a public plane (planes.role: public)\nre-gates itself against its canon before publishing, refuses on any failure, and\nwill plan but not apply when it cannot find that canon unless planes.regate: false\nsays so; ingest is refused in a public plane. clone-framework marks the plane it\nscaffolds, and keeps its static surface off until it has a URL.\n\nAlso: a store whose file name is the type (what export writes) carries no type on\nits objects, so no exported entry could pass record validation. publish now supplies\nit on the record without rewriting the file — found by the first test that publishes\nfrom an exported plane.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c74cfaaa778f80ebb35c5bbfa9703b1dccddd8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/6c74cfaaa778f80ebb35c5bbfa9703b1dccddd8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDBlYTMwMjg5YWFkZDNiNTY3ZTlmMmNiNjU2MmYyMjRhMjU3NDIyOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582","sha":"31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582"}],"sha":"0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/0ea30289aadd3b567e9f2cb6562f224a2574228d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:27:28Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:27:28Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/kms-standard-site'' into feat/kms-two-plane-gate\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tpackages/org-os-kms/docs/CONNECTORS.md","tree":{"sha":"3d8cbeab6423a60cdfb1cc633cd8d70386ac1088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/3d8cbeab6423a60cdfb1cc633cd8d70386ac1088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDMxYmM0NDlmMjg4MWQ2Yzg4MTU5Zjg4ZjE3OTY4M2IzY2NjYzM1ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400","sha":"4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd","sha":"c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd"}],"sha":"31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/31bc449f2881d6c88159f88f179683b3cccc3582"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:24:08Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:24:08Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(kms): publish each entry also as a standard.site document\n\nOpt-in via kms.yaml atproto.standard_site. The <authority>.<schema> record\nstays the entry and is unchanged; a site.standard.document (TID record key\nderived from the object id) renders it and points back through a strongRef\nin the content union, under one site.standard.publication per commons.\n\nPlan-first, idempotent and deterministic: state lives in the publish\nmanifest under standardSite; a document follows its entry (update on a new\nentry version, delete when the entry leaves the selection). Validation\nerrors are reported in the plan and never block the entries. Language is\ntaken from the object or config and omitted when unknown. The publication''s\n.well-known verification file is written into the static surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"017446021c54a03ebf1512fabb83c3ff9064b877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/017446021c54a03ebf1512fabb83c3ff9064b877"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGM4NzM3ZWJhNDgyMjJhZWM5ZDAxNWIyZjViNzViNGIxMjI1NTAxY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/c249ba015dac165fe9f75e38009394705bff2ed8","sha":"c249ba015dac165fe9f75e38009394705bff2ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c249ba015dac165fe9f75e38009394705bff2ed8"}],"sha":"c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c8737eba48222aec9d015b2f5b75b4b1225501cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:22:31Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:23:21Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(kms): each public plane declares its own extra public fields, and clone-framework scaffolds a canon with its public plane\n\nField policy: the allowlist is no longer only constants. A public plane''s kms.yaml\nmay add fields under publish.public_fields (per schema, or \"*\") and\npublish.nested_fields; export, the writer, the generated mirror and the re-gate all\nread the same policy through loadCommonsPolicy. An instance can only add, and\nnaming a field the framework holds private is refused when the policy is built.\n\nClone: kms.public_plane in the clone config makes the new instance a canon —\nplanes.public in its kms.yaml, its own source card completed the way the gate\nrequires (self, internal-only, claiming its checkout) — and scaffolds the public\nplane under repos/ as an instance and git repository of its own, with a card in a\npublishable shape. A freshly cloned pair exports and re-gates cleanly.\n\nThe generator test and its fixture are excluded from clones; the shipped-file\nmanifest is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22eff31d6d67397647e2f65fff7677c202052e21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/22eff31d6d67397647e2f65fff7677c202052e21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDRkMjBiOTM1MDZhNjExMWQ2YjM1MmZlNTY4N2E1ZWM4MDhlYTg0MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b","sha":"f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b"}],"sha":"4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4d20b93506a6111d6b352fe5687a5ec808ea8400"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:17:53Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:17:53Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(kms): the two planes move into the framework — canon, publication gate, export and re-gate, behind export and validate verbs\n\nLifted from lf-work-os scripts/kms (the Regenerant Catalunya commons), where the\nprivate canon, the fail-closed publication gate, the field allowlist, the contained\nwriter, the export and the re-gate lived as instance code. Twelve modules land in\nsrc/planes/ with only their import paths changed, then one seam is cut: the public\nplane is no longer a constant but the canon''s own declaration (kms.yaml\nplanes.public.instance, dir defaulting to repos/<instance>; COMMONS_DIR still\noverrides the directory). The two scripts become exportCommons / validateCommons\nbehind new CLI verbs.\n\n204 of the 213 tests move and pass with their assertions untouched; the nine left\nbehind read Catalunya''s real canon and stay with that instance. Field allowlist\ncontents and writer extras are still Catalunya''s — parameterised next.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5f03e1e36e9cb82b3fbb13f742faad0ea0a1ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/c5f03e1e36e9cb82b3fbb13f742faad0ea0a1ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGY3MTNjZjJkNjk3NTY4ODJjNTQwNDU2YTU0Njc3MGRlNzVjYmMzOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b","sha":"20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b"}],"sha":"f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/f713cf2d69756882c540456a546770de75cbc38b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:02:34Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:02:34Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): clone-framework applies the org-os-kms profile — a kms: block yields an instance born a knowledge system\n\nThe clone vendored toolkit-framework, org-os-kms and extension packs but left the\ninstance without kms.yaml or a self card, and a hand-run init named it after its\ndirectory. Stage 7b now runs org-os-kms init with the configured name and merges\nextensions, store policy and federation namespace into kms.yaml, before the genesis\ncommit. A kms block whose packages or extensions are not enabled is refused before\nstage 1 writes anything.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"021123621e49e297ef7b9ee4f63a7e8d0ddf2993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/021123621e49e297ef7b9ee4f63a7e8d0ddf2993"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDIwZDNiMjQ2ZGMwZTU2ZmFjYzQwOTRmNjc1MDIzMmI5MWExYzQ5NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/c249ba015dac165fe9f75e38009394705bff2ed8","sha":"c249ba015dac165fe9f75e38009394705bff2ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/c249ba015dac165fe9f75e38009394705bff2ed8"}],"sha":"20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/20d3b246dc0e56facc4094f6750232b91a1c495b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%