:null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/95253b70d3eae05ccce5c4fe5fb906c96bb671d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:25:41Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:25:41Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(kms,framework): per-instance JSON-LD context, stale extensions.yaml, pack-load error messages, docs\n\n- toJsonLdContext takes { packs }; the static surface scopes api/context.jsonld to the instance''s own packs\n- a pack-less surface drops a stale public extensions.yaml\n- registerPack rejects re-registration with different entities/types; hasOwn checks for entity and binding collisions\n- pack.yaml parse errors name the file; connectors/index.mjs import failures name the pack\n- objectsIn tolerates null objects; toolkit-framework lockfile version 0.3.0\n- CONNECTORS §13 accuracy (half-loaded, resetRegistryBindings, connectors are executed), anchor links\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b4befdeb1604e73ff9d3f83aa5d735a30f45377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/3b4befdeb1604e73ff9d3f83aa5d735a30f45377"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/95253b70d3eae05ccce5c4fe5fb906c96bb671d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/95253b70d3eae05ccce5c4fe5fb906c96bb671d7","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDk1MjUzYjcwZDNlYWUwNWNjY2U1YzRmZTVmYjkwNmM5NmJiNjcxZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/2d2eb012f2c50d6cf8d066826349813c28ac3aa6","sha":"2d2eb012f2c50d6cf8d066826349813c28ac3aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2d2eb012f2c50d6cf8d066826349813c28ac