opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:10:12Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"test(kms): extension packs end to end\n\nThe real org-os-territory pack through bridge and publish: not opted in, it\nloads and bridges and publishes nothing new; opted in, a publishable unit\nreaches the PDS and the static surface projected, and a not-public-yet\nstream stays below the floor. A pack-less instance produces the core surface\nand nothing else.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc4e8b0c3e1a5db1734036bad28408fc55a39103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/fc4e8b0c3e1a5db1734036bad28408fc55a39103"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/675289bf2703850393768d8dc0548b3f48856f28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/675289bf2703850393768d8dc0548b3f48856f28","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDY3NTI4OWJmMjcwMzg1MDM5Mzc2OGQ4ZGMwNTQ4YjNmNDg4NTZmMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5","sha":"a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5"}],"sha":"675289bf2703850393768d8dc0548b3f48856f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/675289bf2703850393768d8dc0548b3f48856f28"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:06:30Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:06:30Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(territory): the overlaps sidecar contract — validateOverlaps\n\ndata/territory-overlaps.json holds cross-layer overlap shares: derived,\nrecomputable, never published. This fixes its shape and validates it (known\nunits, different layers, shares in (0, 1], no duplicate pairs) so the script\nthat computes it from real geometry has a contract to hit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"714124957b618c4856ea04fdb8528fd100d2e173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/714124957b618c4856ea04fdb8528fd100d2e173"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGEwNjk5NTM1NGE3NmNjMTJlYjQ0ODlkZTAyMzc2NzEyZGRmNDVhZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7b8703206264d061aab1a139acb94cb6313ac544","sha":"7b8703206264d061aab1a139acb94cb6313ac544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7b8703206264d061aab1a139acb94cb6313ac544"}],"sha":"a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/a06995354a76cc12eb4489de02376712ddf45af5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7b8703206264d061aab1a139acb94cb6313ac544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:04:18Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:04:18Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(territory): units helper — indexUnits, unitsFor, objectsIn\n\nPure, no geometry: index 