ts/123e28de40ee9043789949fdc0f3ae9e689f4ad5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/38649bc4ec29c0edcc540222c641b6ad1af4bff5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T23:16:57Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T23:16:57Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): port regen-toolkit framework changes — validateObject, util, adapters\n\n- validateObject enforces `type: array` (\"<field> must be an array\")\n- util: isAwaitingReview treats `held` like raw; new sameStoredObject\n- kb-folder + repo-data adapters: B5 silent-overwrite guard — distinct\n  title-slugs never clobber (hash-suffixed key); store() now returns\n  { stored, collisions }. repo-data still exports slugFor and store still\n  returns { stored }, so runConnector''s pre-store collision detection coexists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b53fb0be2bd963a0d26e725f8d3cb28bb59013f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/b53fb0be2bd963a0d26e725f8d3cb28bb59013f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/38649bc4ec29c0edcc540222c641b6ad1af4bff5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/38649bc4ec29c0edcc540222c641b6ad1af4bff5","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDM4NjQ5YmM0ZWMyOWMwZWRjYzU0MDIyMmM2NDFiNmFkMWFmNGJmZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/27c9e5798f83ad5cbb4e2840324f4df3e97a40df","sha":"27c9e5798f83ad5cbb4e2840324f4df3e97a40df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/27c9e5798f83ad5cbb4e2840324f4df3e97a40df"}],"sha":"38649bc4ec29c0edcc540222c641b6ad1af4bff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/38649bc4ec29c0edcc540222c641b6ad1af4bff5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/27c9e5798f83ad5cbb4e2840324f4df3e97a40df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T23:16:48Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T23:16:48Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): port regen-toolkit framework changes — schemas, axes, enums, entities\n\nPorts regen-toolkit''s July 2026 local schema work into the canonical copy:\n- review-maturity: `held` maturity state; currentness / confidence /\n  maintenance status axes (relationship-record''s `confidence` axis now resolves)\n- source-system enum +blog/publication/organization/movement/platform;\n  public-use-boundary +requires-domain-review; claim-evidence +evidence_stance;\n  implementation-record +record_stage\n- track.outcome scalar -> array\n- extension-entities: relationship-record + organization mappings\n- schemas/person.yaml (per-instance person entry; never publishable)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d0794cd75f08f2c7c918cc30c484b4a3c44e40a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/1d0794cd75f08f2c7c918cc30c484b4a3c44e40a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/27c9e5798f83ad5cbb4e2840324f4df3e97a40df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/27c9e5798f83ad5cbb4e2840324f4df3e97a40df","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDI3YzllNTc5OGY4M2FkNWNiYjRlMjg0MDMyNGY0ZGYzZTk3YTQwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/2a9363f760ec0498a55935ec7e34992d15549db3","sha":"2a9363f760ec0498a55935ec7e34992d15549d