erified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/eb0181d112573d5a4113f7e76f08de119f003852","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGViMDE4MWQxMTI1NzNkNWE0MTEzZjdlNzZmMDhkZTExOWYwMDM4NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966","sha":"932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966"}],"sha":"eb0181d112573d5a4113f7e76f08de119f003852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/eb0181d112573d5a4113f7e76f08de119f003852"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:20:43Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:20:43Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): generate AT Proto Lexicons from yaml schemas + record validator\n\n- Lexicon generator: src/lexicon.mjs with nsidFor, typeForNsid, flattenSchema, generateLexicon, generateAll\n- Record validator + toRecord: validates required fields, types, floats, size limits; applies publicView to strip PRIVATE_FIELDS before building AT Proto records\n- Generator script: scripts/gen-lexicons.mjs (npm run gen:lexicons)\n- 12 committed lexicon JSON files in lexicons/ directory (one per ALL_TYPES entry)\n- Test suite: test/lexicon.test.mjs with 7 tests including revision-3 drift check and publicView application test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab8824080d849e2136f9c619ce9c458adbaa9aeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/ab8824080d849e2136f9c619ce9c458adbaa9aeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDkzMmQxM2VkZjY3MzcyNmMzNWQ0Nzc4NGUwOTVlZDAxMWI0MDY5NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14","sha":"89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14"}],"sha":"932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/932d13edf673726c35d47784e095ed011b406966"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:15:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:15:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): id / grc20Id / sourceUri / viaUri on frontmatter\n\nAdd four optional string fields to the shared frontmatter schema:\n- id: stable object id (UUIDv4) minted at first publish\n- grc20Id: Geo entity id for semantic equivalence\n- sourceUri: immutable origin AT-URI (first publisher)\n- viaUri: immediate peer AT-URI this copy was pulled from\n\nAll PUBLISHABLE_TYPES inherit these fields via frontmatter extends.\nTest verifies schema completeness and validateObject accepts the fields.","tree":{"sha":"8c6c42a69e1376d86fa6b87e54cc8a03ea79850d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/8c6c42a69e1376d86fa6b87e54cc8a03ea79850d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDg5NDIwZThmMTljNjI1NzEwYjVkYjk5OGJjZjU0NmQyN2ZmYmZlMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6","sha":"4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6"}],"sha":"89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/89420e8f19c625710b5db998bcf546d27ffbfe14"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:10:02Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T20:10:02Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(framework): schema-keyed publication gate, opt-in types, outbound projection\n\nImplements the publication gate module that defines which knowledge objects are\npublishable (keyed on schema, not object.type), defines the PUBLISHABLE_TYPES\nand OPT_IN_TYPES constants, and provides the publicView projection that strips\neditorial-only fields before objects leave the instance.\n\nExports:\n- PUBLISHABLE_TYPES (10 types)\n- OPT_IN_TYPES (source-system, public-use-boundary)\n- ALL_TYPES (combined publishable + opt-in)\n- PUBLISHABLE_PUBLIC_USE (4 review maturity values)\n- publishableTypes(config) function for opt-in/opt-out composition\n- isPublishable(object, options) predicate keyed on schema\n- PRIVATE_FIELDS list of editorial internals\n- publicView(object) projection that never mutates input\n\nAlso adds missing schema files (organization.yaml, relationship-record.yaml) that\nwere in regen-toolkit but not yet in org-os.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3cb3808646e902f6ccc283dca91d23c7202a754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/d3cb3808646e902f6ccc283dca91d23c7202a754"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDRmN2UxMjIzMmZiZmFjYTQzNjRmMmUxN2YyYmFlZTY0Yzk5NWNmZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16","sha":"2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16"}],"sha":"4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4f7e12232fbfaca4364f2e17f2baee64c995cfe6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:29:00Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:29:00Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-framework): templates, partials and the version stamp come from HEAD too\n\nStage 2 copied committed blobs only, but stage 7 still rendered the instance''s\nREADME, GETTING-STARTED, CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md from templates and partials\nread off disk, and stage 6 read package.json''s version off disk. An\nuncommitted template line (or a secret pasted into one) reached the instance\nand its genesis commit, and an uncommitted version bump was stamped into\nfederation.yaml and DECISIONS.md while every copied file came from HEAD.\n\nreadFrameworkFile() reads a framework file the generator uses without copying\nfrom its committed blob at HEAD (a file missing from HEAD is an error, never a\nsilent disk read); partials are passed to render() as a map built from HEAD.\nIn the non-git fallback both read from disk, consistent with that warned mode.\nThe generator''s own code and rules still execute from disk.\n\nThe structural test adds an uncommitted line in templates/AGENTS.instance.md,\none in templates/partials/cheatsheet.md, and a package.json bump to 9.9.9.\nAgainst 6caa246 it fails (AGENTS.md and GETTING-STARTED.md carry the marker;\nwith that check disabled, the version-stamp assertion fails); it passes now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fff7d7e32d5e88062698d6e2022defd4d141a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/9fff7d7e32d5e88062698d6e2022defd4d141a46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDI4MTVlNTcxMGM1NzMwNzgyN2ViN2RkNzVjMzljNjEyZmJmYmVhMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3","sha":"6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3"}],"sha":"2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2815e5710c57307827eb7dd75c39c612fbfbea16"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:18:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:18:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"test(clone-genesis): dashboard.yaml is generated at genesis, no longer a must-not-exist path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe8ab2f5ceb49b7e8b2297849447bc6f76c58953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/fe8ab2f5ceb49b7e8b2297849447bc6f76c58953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDZjYWEyNDY1MmZhYjczM2QxMzIzYThjYmJlYTI0M2M4OWQ4NzNmYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8","sha":"a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8"}],"sha":"6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/6caa24652fab733d1323a8cbbea243c89d873fc3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:17:13Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:17:13Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(clone-framework): pin every path a fresh instance receives in tests/clone-manifest.txt\n\nThe containment test checks the generator against its own rules\n(topLevelDecision / isPathExcluded), so it can never catch a wrong ALLOW:\nbelow the top level it was still a deny-list. A committed private note under\ndocs/, a new registry under data/ or a new workflow under .github/ shipped\nwith every test green.\n\ntests/clone-manifest.txt now lists every path a fresh clone of the reference\nfixture contains, sorted, one per line. tests/clone-genesis.test.mjs requires\nan exact match and names both unexpected and missing paths.\n`npm run clone:manifest` regenerates it (`-- --check` reports staleness).\nThe friction is deliberate: adding a framework file that instances receive\nmeans committing it, regenerating, and reviewing a diff that shows exactly\nwhat every new organisation will inherit. The manifest and its generator are\nthemselves framework-only and excluded from clones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c95d984648fe0e128bd70b5a911685a9fbd9fb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/9c95d984648fe0e128bd70b5a911685a9fbd9fb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGE4OGFjYjgxNmNkYWQyYWIwNzg0MTVkOTRmNGY5OTY5MTZhZWZhYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957","sha":"8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957"}],"sha":"a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/a88acb816cdad2ab078415d94f4f996916aefaa8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:17:02Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:17:02Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-excludes): exclude further framework-only content found walking a fresh clone\n\n- docs/KNOWLEDGE-INITIATION.md — the framework network''s knowledge population\n  plan, with paths into the maintainer''s own workspace.\n- docs/knowledge-commons-astro-stack.md — research report for the framework''s\n  org-os-kms package.\n- docs/QUILT.md — generated view of the framework itself; an instance weaves\n  its own with `npm run generate:quilt`.\n- docs/integrations/cloudflare-os.md — the framework''s own deployment runbook,\n  naming another organisation''s repository as its peer and token owner.\n- scripts/test-federation.sh — hardcoded paths into the maintainer''s workspace.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74873cdefa31d34cbc403eb4013869046e3a1056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/74873cdefa31d34cbc403eb4013869046e3a1056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDg3ODUwODNhMzBmODE4MTkwMmMzZTExNDhjN2Q3YjY4MWNhZjE5NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8","sha":"7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8"}],"sha":"8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/8785083a30f8181902c3e1148c7d7b681caf1957"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:16:17Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:16:17Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(clone-framework): render the instance''s AGENTS.md and a neutral dashboard.yaml at genesis\n\nAGENTS.md: the rendered CLAUDE.md sends every session to AGENTS.md, whose\nframework copy calls the workspace \"the upstream reference\" and \"the upstream\nframework\" — undoing the CLAUDE.md fix one hop later. Stage 7 now renders\ntemplates/AGENTS.instance.md: the generic protocol (safety, startup sequence,\nmemory, subagents, coordination, approvals, voice, skills, packages,\nfederation) kept; the knowledge-commons/Agent Dojo framework role, the legacy\nrepository-name history, the nonexistent `npm run sync` and `.memory-sync.sh`\ncron dropped.\n\ndashboard.yaml: the framework''s copy stays denied (its custom sections read\nregistries stripped at genesis), but stage 4b now writes a commented instance\nversion with every default section and the exact values of\nloadDashboardConfig() in scripts/initialize.mjs, so docs/FILE-STRUCTURE.md\nstays true and operators have a starting point.\n\nCLAUDE.md: /close pushes once a remote is configured; a new instance has none.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4098c0e405e1543fc76a5602a1d016a36fa9037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/e4098c0e405e1543fc76a5602a1d016a36fa9037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDdlZjdjZjJmNTY5M2I3YjIyMjg3MGY0NzRkNzg2MTU5ODViZDNiZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc","sha":"12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc"}],"sha":"7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7ef7cf2f5693b7b222870f474d78615985bd3bd8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:16:09Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:16:09Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-excludes): stop shipping framework strategy docs, the Buzz deployment runbook, dead fixtures and the framework README renderer\n\nContent a fresh clone carried that a new organisation should not inherit:\n- docs/POSITIONING.md, V2-DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md, RAD-ORG-OS.md, ECOSYSTEM.md —\n  the framework''s self-description, roadmap and repository registry.\n- docs/integrations/buzz.md — excluded rather than placeholdered: the whole\n  runbook documents the framework''s own deployment (hosted relay, binary path,\n  channel UUID), not a setup an instance could follow as written.\n- tests/fixtures/paper/ and tests/fixtures/bread-coop-config.yaml — consumed\n  only by suites that are already excluded.\n- scripts/render-templates.mjs with templates/README.framework.md and\n  templates/session-one-pager.md — it renders the FRAMEWORK''s README and\n  imports site/, so in an instance it could only crash (6d now drops\n  render:templates).\n\ndocs/VAULT-SAFETY.md: the rules stay, the incident narrative moves to a new\nframework-only docs/VAULT-SAFETY-CASE-STUDY.md. A split rather than trimming\nat genesis: the instance copy is then an ordinary committed file the clone\nmanifest can pin, with no generator logic keyed to heading text. The rules\nalso drop a vault-specific directory example.\n\nFramework docs an instance inherits no longer point at what it lacks:\nBOOTSTRAP.md cited data/instances.yaml and the bread-coop fixture;\n.env.example cited docs/superpowers specs and a ReFi BCN header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1db5e7c46faaf35393c0684c248d45c80dd9f0ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/1db5e7c46faaf35393c0684c248d45c80dd9f0ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDEyZDBhNTBiMjM5YjZkYzE3M2E4YWNmMzIxNjk3NzY0NDFlN2RlY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0","sha":"4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0"}],"sha":"12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/12d0a50b239b6dc173a8acf32169776441e7decc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:16:09Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:16:09Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"docs(federation): use a placeholder name in the governance.maintainers example\n\nThe sample maintainers entry named a real person. Every instance inherits this\ndocument, so the example now reads \"Example Maintainer\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1449f6fa657a9136b049093fbae17587b74a021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/b1449f6fa657a9136b049093fbae17587b74a021"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDRiNWUzOGYzYTE4YjU4YjRmZGY3ZDI2MjlmMTNmZjYxZDY1M2Y5YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08","sha":"b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08"}],"sha":"4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/4b5e38f3a18b58b4fdf7d2629f13ff61d653f9a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:15:50Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T21:15:50Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-framework): only committed content travels — copy HEAD blobs; no genesis commit in the non-git fallback\n\nThe copy set came from the index and the bytes from the working tree, so\ncontent git calls tracked but never committed still reached a clone: a secret\npasted into the tracked .env.example, a staged-only file, an intent-to-add\n(`git add -N`) file, and a skip-worktree edit invisible to `git status`. The\nleaf-only isFile() check also let a committed directory swapped on disk for a\nsymlink pull files from outside the repository — a regression against the old\nwalk, which skipped it.\n\nStage 2 now builds the source set from `git ls-tree -r HEAD` and writes each\nfile from its committed blob via one `git cat-file --batch` process (no temp\ntree, no second pass over the filesystem). Symlinks (120000) and gitlinks are\nskipped; the executable bit comes from the tree mode. A new framework file\nreaches instances only once it is committed.\n\nThe non-git fallback warned \"inspect before committing\" and then committed in\nstage 8 anyway. It now skips the genesis commit unless --commit-unverified is\npassed, and repeats the warning after the final line of output.\n\nStage 6d no longer treats `cd -` or an absolute `cd` target as a missing\nclone directory.\n\nThe structural test reproduces all four uncommitted-content cases, the\nparent-symlink swap, both cd forms and the fallback commit behaviour in a\ndisposable framework clone; run against the previous generator it fails on\n.env.example, docs/swap/a.md, scripts/intent-to-add.txt, scripts/selftest.mjs\nand scripts/staged-secret.txt. The containment test''s source set is HEAD.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"289129c0b2c819896bd2f2cf445dca52084fd772","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/289129c0b2c819896bd2f2cf445dca52084fd772"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGIxYzhkZjFhYTlkMDlhNjg2NGMwOGVlYTczZGIwNWMzOWEyZTJlMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c","sha":"316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c"}],"sha":"b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/b1c8df1aa9d09a6864c08eea73db05c39a2e2e08"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:57:38Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:57:38Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"test(clone-genesis): mirror only regular files into the disposable framework\n\nA symlinked node_modules is untracked but not matched by the `node_modules/`\nignore pattern, so the working-tree mirror tried to copy it as a file and\nfailed. Found by running the suite from a checkout whose node_modules is a\nsymlink.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06befe1fdeb222058924cc351155ca7849a8a25d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/06befe1fdeb222058924cc351155ca7849a8a25d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDMxNmVjNWRlMGIwYWQ1YjA5ODJkOTFjNTllMWU2MmNhZWUzNWNkNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee","sha":"298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee"}],"sha":"316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/316ec5de0b0ad5b0982d91c59e1e62caee35cd4c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:55:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:55:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"test(clone-genesis): park the disposable framework''s .git instead of deleting it\n\nA git background process can still be writing inside the disposable clone''s\n.git when the non-git fallback is exercised; a recursive rm then fails with\nENOTEMPTY. Move it aside, and retry the final temp-dir cleanup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73a720a2745d116c967bdcc4e3f88b3378ed044b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/73a720a2745d116c967bdcc4e3f88b3378ed044b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDI5OGM0NjRmOWQ4Y2UyMDY0NGUxZTdlZmJiMjdjMTI4YmRiODBkZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93","sha":"717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93"}],"sha":"298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/298c464f9d8ce20644e1e7efbb27c128bdb80dee"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:27Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-framework): stage 6d drops --prefix and cd scripts whose directory the clone lacks\n\n6d skipped `npm --prefix <dir>` and `cd <dir> && …` forms, so a clone kept\nbuild:site / serve:site (cd into another organisation''s knowledge repo),\nadmin*, test:admin, test:cloudflare-os-integration, test:multica-bridge and\npaperclip*. Both forms are now resolved against the clone and dropped when the\ndirectory is absent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ff4cad4ce12e16cbbe588ad8d00ff47b9b3fd5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/1ff4cad4ce12e16cbbe588ad8d00ff47b9b3fd5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDcxN2IzMGYzNGNhY2VjYzcxNGY3MmNkYzNmMGYwZWY4ZmEyZDdkOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069","sha":"2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069"}],"sha":"717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/717b30f34cacecc714f72cdc3f0f0ef8fa2d7d93"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:26Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:26Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-framework): stage 6e repoints docs/agent-plans/ in the clone''s docs too\n\nOnly command files were repointed, so instance-bound documentation\n(docs/PLANS.md with 8 references, docs/VERSIONING.md, docs/SKILL-PROMOTION.md\nand others) still pointed at a directory an instance does not have. Every\nmarkdown file under the clone''s docs/ is now rewritten; the framework''s own\ncopies are untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36f3e569f71706edd3758402d778bc1a2ccd721c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/36f3e569f71706edd3758402d778bc1a2ccd721c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDJjODUyMjM5ZDc0ZDhkY2E5ODBlMGVkNTJlY2U1NTIxM2M0OTcwNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf","sha":"d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf"}],"sha":"2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/2c852239d74d8dca980e0ed52ece55213c497069"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:26Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:26Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-framework): genesis dao.json substitutes a host, not a URL (no more https://https://)\n\n.well-known/dao.json.template owns the `https://` scheme before {{BASE_URL}},\nand generate-all-schemas.mjs (new URL(daoURI).host) and setup-org-os.mjs both\nsubstitute a bare host. Stage 6c alone passed a full URL, so every fresh\ninstance published `https://https://…` in each URI field. Stage 6c now\nnormalises org.base_url (with or without a scheme) to its host; the contract\nis noted where generate-all-schemas reads it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8db1026817d53676d2616776156416f142e05bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/8db1026817d53676d2616776156416f142e05bd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGQxYmEwMzA5OWVmOTVjNDc5NDE5NDZiOWVhMjZhNzMzZWZhNmQyYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa","sha":"1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa"}],"sha":"d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/d1ba03099ef95c47941946b9ea26a733efa6d2bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-framework): copy tracked files under a declared top level; the instance gets its own CLAUDE.md\n\nStage 2 walked the filesystem and subtracted a hand-maintained deny-list, so\nit could not see content that did not exist yet: seven leaks were patched one\nentry at a time, and one basename regex was all that stood between a clone and\n.npmrc / .netrc / *.pem / credentials.json.\n\nNow the copy set is built in three layers:\n- source set: `git ls-files` in the framework root. Untracked and gitignored\n  files are structurally uncopyable. A non-git checkout (zip download) falls\n  back to the filesystem walk with a prominent warning that the secret-safety\n  guarantee does not hold.\n- top level: every entry is declared in TOP_LEVEL_ALLOW or TOP_LEVEL_DENY with\n  a one-line reason; an undeclared entry is skipped and logged by name.\n- deny-list: isPathExcluded() checks every ancestor directory, since git lists\n  files, not directories. Credential-shaped names added as defence in depth.\n\nClosed structurally rather than by entry: instances/, renders/, graphify-out/,\nsite/, integrations/, modules/, root strategy documents, CHANGELOG, VERSION.md,\nSKILLS.md, SYNC-GUIDE.md, dashboard.yaml. Also excluded: docs/sessions,\ndocs/research, docs/QUEUE.md, .opencode/agents.\n\nFramework self-description at genesis:\n- CLAUDE.md is rendered from templates/CLAUDE.instance.md (it told every\n  session in a new org that it was the org-os framework).\n- repos.manifest.json is reset to an empty repository list (clone:repos\n  cloned other organisations'' repositories on day one).\n- knowledge/INDEX.md is a fresh stub for the instance.\n\nTests: a containment test fails by name on any clone file that is neither a\ntracked, allowed, non-excluded framework file nor declared generator output;\nevery tracked top-level entry must be declared; a disposable git clone of the\nframework proves untracked .npmrc / credentials.json never travel, a newly\ncommitted top-level directory is skipped and logged, and the non-git fallback\nwarns.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a27c4bd59b4d71941789acbc2e3f1d8595942604","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/a27c4bd59b4d71941789acbc2e3f1d8595942604"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDFlNmEzYmUwZDJhZDZjYzg1NGVhNWE4YzIyZjczN2ZmNWE4ZTAzZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe","sha":"7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe"}],"sha":"1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/1e6a3be0d2ad6cc854ea5a8c22f737ff5a8e03fa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:04Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:54:04Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"docs(clone-excludes): drop a stale local path from the provenance comment\n\nThe three scaffold commits are cited by SHA only; the directory the comment\nnamed no longer exists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84567f91ad8a60c3aab6c23b48ca57b472889d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/84567f91ad8a60c3aab6c23b48ca57b472889d23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDdkZTI2ZjQ0MGE3YjhhZDljNzUyODdkNmViYTE4ZGVmZjQ4Yjc5ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780","sha":"bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780"}],"sha":"7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7de26f440a7b8ad9c75287d6eba18deff48b79fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T04:01:52Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T20:45:18Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(schemas): generateDao() reads identity.short_description, not identity.description\n\nThe canonical identity field for a crafted public description is\nshort_description (clone-framework.mjs, render-templates.mjs, the genesis\nconfig all use it) but generateDao() only ever read identity.description —\na key no generator writes. The boilerplate fallback always fired, silently,\nbecause generateDao() early-returns until identity.daoURI is set; the bug\nstayed invisible until an instance set daoURI for the first time.\n\nFound 2026-09-16 during a PersonalNode instance activation: setting\ndaoURI silently replaced the instance''s crafted description with generic\nboilerplate in the published dao.json.\n\nPrefer short_description, keep description as a fallback so neither\nspelling is silently dropped, and add regression tests proving both fields\nwork and that boilerplate only appears when neither is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"905b185abc7f37310ef8f3b28f4767171c77071f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/905b185abc7f37310ef8f3b28f4767171c77071f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGJkZGVkYzI4YTM3MGU2MmRlZjIyMTM5OThkOTYzMDRjOTYwZTk3ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/f19045d456264187813df7dc61a440c121af494c","sha":"f19045d456264187813df7dc61a440c121af494c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/f19045d456264187813df7dc61a440c121af494c"}],"sha":"bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/bddedc28a370e62def2213998d96304c960e9780"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/f19045d456264187813df7dc61a440c121af494c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:45:23Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:45:23Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix(clone-excludes): exclude the framework''s own site/ website and its framework-only CI workflows\n\nThe framework''s project website (site/, an Astro app, package \"org-os-site\",\ndeploying to regen-coordination.github.io/org-os-template) was being copied\ninto every generated instance, colliding with any instance''s own root site/\n— discovered 2026-09-13 when it collided with the luizfernando instance''s\nvendored Quartz site/ during genesis, the third instance of this defect\nclass after the 2026-07-26 scaffold''s manual strip (ff61a69, 28fa4ba,\nff24018). Adds \"site\" to EXCLUDE_DIRS (root-anchored, not EXCLUDE_ANYWHERE,\nso an instance''s own nested or root site/ is unaffected), and excludes the\nthree .github/workflows/ files coupled to the framework''s own project\n(deploy-pages.yml, drift.yml, validate.yml) while keeping the generic\ngenerate-schemas.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d87f0aaeea9d84abf2577051f41fbb91980e817","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/6d87f0aaeea9d84abf2577051f41fbb91980e817"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/f19045d456264187813df7dc61a4