ination/org-os-template/commits/47905df6fded584b695e4a9c8f7f0c420cee5fc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:21:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:21:15Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"plan(paper): Task 7 gains VERIFIED row 12b — probe whether rejected tool calls are charged against the weekly quota\n\nRaised by the Task 1 review: the metered counter increments only on success, so if Paper bills failed calls the printed count under-reports. One deliberate failure during live verification settles it; the fix if charged is to move the increment before the await.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011W122fioLXGkG1YanFfexF","tree":{"sha":"bbae11fc527f6c6315a48418904a8993fc7ec168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/bbae11fc527f6c6315a48418904a8993fc7ec168"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/47905df6fded584b695e4a9c8f7f0c420cee5fc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/47905df6fded584b695e4a9c8f7f0c420cee5fc9","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDQ3OTA1ZGY2ZmRlZDU4NGI2OTVlNGE5YzhmN2YwYzQyMGNlZTVmYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/ca17385af2f3f0a1bc8c74e54a5166165f2b4440","sha":"ca17385af2f3f0a1bc8c74e54a5166165f2b4440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/ca17385af2f3f0a1bc8c74e54a5166165f2b4440"}],"sha":"47905df6fded584b695e4a9c8f7f0c420cee5fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/47905df6fded584b695e4a9c8f7f0c420cee5fc9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-