thropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011W122fioLXGkG1YanFfexF","tree":{"sha":"ffe23a32bfb4e6f2370d37210c51b026e00b812e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/ffe23a32bfb4e6f2370d37210c51b026e00b812e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/5e3f4a9430087efbd2122c09c37869de6c06d261","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/5e3f4a9430087efbd2122c09c37869de6c06d261","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDVlM2Y0YTk0MzAwODdlZmJkMjEyMmMwOWMzNzg2OWRlNmMwNmQyNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b","sha":"15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b"}],"sha":"5e3f4a9430087efbd2122c09c37869de6c06d261","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/5e3f4a9430087efbd2122c09c37869de6c06d261"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T13:08:26Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T13:08:26Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"spec(paper): Paper x org-os integration design — thin token bridge + canvas skill, prototype in refi-dao-os\n\nModule org-os-paper: packages/paper-integration (JSON-RPC client, free doctor, brand.yaml -> Paper token push + drift lint, VERIFIED.md), skills/paper-design, docs/integrations/paper.md. Agents design via Paper MCP directly; the package wraps only health, token sync, and drift. Free-tier budget (100 metered calls/week) is a locked constraint. Prototype: Tier-2 brief 02 (GrowFi social card) on a Paper canvas from refi-dao-os brand.yaml tokens, ceiling 30 calls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011W122fioLXGkG1YanFfexF","tree":{"sha":"2f0d27c58759b888bd0d8b4d2cfc39ab956ac56b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/2f0d27c58759b888bd0d8b4d2cfc39ab956ac56b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDE1ZjhiZmM4OGE5NjQ2N2FhNDExMDQwNDQxY2YyNmIzZTA0NTIzNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/95af117bf89b9cce91516c3019619ab66be0fb37","sha":"95af117bf89b9cce91516c3019619ab66be0fb37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/95af117bf89b9cce91516c3019619ab66be0fb37"}],"sha":"15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/15f8bfc88a96467aa411040441cf26b3e045236b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/org