n-coordination/org-os-template/commits/54761aada5e8c8a2196e6188858e142f0f83ad41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:53:01Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:53:01Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"docs(queue): buzz row — mirror sync done, only the 0/5 dogfood tally pends\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90a96d382956fcb62eded4bc27f7338dbb74979f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/90a96d382956fcb62eded4bc27f7338dbb74979f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/54761aada5e8c8a2196e6188858e142f0f83ad41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/54761aada5e8c8a2196e6188858e142f0f83ad41","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDU0NzYxYWFkYTVlOGM4YTIxOTZlNjE4ODg1OGUxNDJmMGY4M2FkNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc","sha":"e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc"}],"sha":"54761aada5e8c8a2196e6188858e142f0f83ad41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/54761aada5e8c8a2196e6188858e142f0f83ad41"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:48:20Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T12:48:20Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"docs(buzz,berd): operator runbooks for the two agent lanes\n\nFull review pass of modules #3 (org-os-buzz) and #4 (org-os-berd) against\ntheir specs, VERIFIED.md, and the HEARTBEAT acceptance trackers, verified\nlive this session (doctor 4/4 green, berd mirror 5/5 in-sync, 62+19 tests\npassing).\n\n- docs/integrations/buzz.md (new): day-to-day runbook — what the\n  /initialize read-back and /close digest-post hooks do on each of the\n  eight surfaces, relay start/stop via ~/tools/buzz/deploy/compose/run.sh,\n  joining #org-os-dev (channels list name->UUID, run.sh add-member),\n  VERIFIED.md/CLI_MAP contract rules, and what remains unverified (0/5\n  dogfood tally, nothing multi-party exercised).\n- docs/integrations/berd.md: new Operating section — edit-canon-never-\n  mirror loop, manifest-as-curation, the --check drift gate, running a\n  session from Berd, and the plainly-stated gap: five skills discovered\n  and parsed but never exercised under Goose; acceptance 0/5.\n- docs/MODULES.md: org-os-buzz status no longer claims the machine-local\n  mirror sync is outstanding (all surfaces verified 2026-08-29); link the\n  new runbook.\n- HEARTBEAT.md: tick the machine-local mirror prerequisite with the\n  inspection evidence (in-repo half closed in 7b9a78c, Berd mirror in\n  e3b1dc0, user-level mirrors verified + exercised live today).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d39ebe5f8a4893418da4663886c5d67e674ccf53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/d39ebe5f8a4893418da4663886c5d67e674ccf53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGUwOTM4ZmUzODM3Mjg5YmQ1MTM5ODNhNjQ1YTc3ZDdjYmI5NzkzY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7","sha":"e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7"}],"sha":"e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/e0938fe3837289bd513983a645a77d7cbb9793cc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T11:58:36Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T11:58:36Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(berd): re-materialise org-os-init mirror after session hooks landed\n\nThe drift gate caught it: editing skills/org-os-init/SKILL.md left its\n.agents/skills/ mirror stale, --check reported drift (exit 1) on that skill\nalone while the other four stayed in-sync. Re-ran sync:skills:berd; --check\nnow green 5/5 and goosed parses the updated copy (2564 -> 2828 tokens).\n\nFirst real-world exercise of the marker-guarded mirror + drift gate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db51b3bb61b7a62e21aecbeb8f3e1e03b68582c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/db51b3bb61b7a62e21aecbeb8f3e1e03b68582c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKGUzYjFkYzAyMWI2ODkxZTVhOTE4YTM4MGI4OTMxNTM0NmEwYmJjYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7b9a78c18d6bd8ec4a60f6b3db1cb9587ea75d1b","sha":"7b9a78c18d6bd8ec4a60f6b3db1cb9587ea75d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7b9a78c18d6bd8ec4a60f6b3db1cb9587ea75d1b"}],"sha":"e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/e3b1dc021b6891e5a918a380b89315346a0bbca7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commits/7b9a78c18d6bd8ec4a60f6b3db1cb9587ea75d1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T11:57:29Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T11:57:29Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat(buzz): add fail-open session hooks to initialize/org-os-init skills\n\nGoose/Hermes discover skills from ~/.claude/skills/ and the repo''s own\nskills/ tree, not .claude/commands/ — so the Buzz read-back and post hooks\nnever reached those surfaces despite being live in the command files. Add\nthe read-back hook to skills/initialize/SKILL.md (Step 3b, before session\ncontext) and both hooks to skills/org-os-init/SKILL.md Phase 1/Phase 4,\nadapted to each file''s own numbering.","tree":{"sha":"c2e7dd5fd106837d7ade8b2e8f85fe83f5917b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/trees/c2e7dd5fd106837d7ade8b2e8f85fe83f5917b05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/regen-coordination/org-os-template/git/commits/7b9a78c18d6bd8ec4a60f6b3db1cb9587ea75d1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/7b9a78c18d6bd8ec4a60f6b3db1cb9587ea75d1b","node_id":"C_kwDOReKBZtoAKDdiOWE3OGMxOGQ2YmQ4ZWM0YTYwZjZiM2RiMWNiOTU4N2VhNzVkMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/regen-coordination/org-os-template/commit/d895987366b4d526351f31f91a591d77