}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subhanayaz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/subhanayaz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/subhanayaz/micro-frontend-architecture/commits/6871b6945c431b5946fd083b2a75e1dd0b19bb8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T13:32:05Z","email":"66430769+subhanayaz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Subhan Ayaz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T13:32:05Z","email":"66430769+subhanayaz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Subhan Ayaz"},"message":"Add portal shell, product UIs, packages and CI/CD\n\nInitial scaffold for a micro-frontend monorepo: adds portal-shell and two product UI apps, shared packages (auth-client, design-system, observability, shared-types), pnpm/turbo workspace config, tooling (prettier, .npmrc, .gitignore) and Docker/Nginx configs for each app. Implements portal-shell React app structure (components, routing, auth/session management, token refresh, module federation loader/registry, RBAC evaluator, Redux store and query client, telemetry init) and product UI app stubs. Adds GitHub Actions workflows to run typecheck/lint/tests, build and push container images, and update ArgoCD manifests.","tree":{"sha":"7498c721e6d764690da5a2ea914bfa74d95127bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/subhanayaz/micro-frontend-architecture/git/trees/7498c721e6d764690da5a2ea914bfa74d95127bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/subhanayaz/micro-frontend-architecture/git/commits/6871b6945c431b5946fd083b2a75e1dd0b19bb8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66430769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subhanayaz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subhanayaz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subhanayaz/following{/other_user}","gists_