n- Introduced ImageWithFallback component for handling image loading errors.\n- Implemented ThemeToggle component for switching between light and dark modes.\n- Established useTranslation hook for language management and translations.\n- Set up Zustand store for app state management including theme and language.\n- Added translations for English, Spanish, and Portuguese.\n- Configured TypeScript and Vite for project setup.","tree":{"sha":"fef7f62df8cb7a3370ebec14b36ba879d5a99764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alrimoreno26/personal-cv/git/trees/fef7f62df8cb7a3370ebec14b36ba879d5a99764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alrimoreno26/personal-cv/git/commits/90b648c652d0ea32bdba175a8f5ccf1d63ae6863","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/alrimoreno26/personal-cv/commit/90b648c652d0ea32bdba175a8f5ccf1d63ae6863","node_id":"C_kwDOReP279oAKDkwYjY0OGM2NTJkMGVhMzJiZGJhMTc1YThmNWNjZjFkNjNhZTY4NjM","parents":[],"sha":"90b648c652d0ea32bdba175a8f5ccf1d63ae6863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alrimoreno26/personal-cv/commits/90b648c652d0ea32bdba175a8f5ccf1d63ae6863"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/alrimoreno26/personal-cv/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=f011ae80ba9597fe60f5a4b2a804f757188e6b79&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A58%3A55.609Z"}');
