g/utils/__init__.py\n\nRe-exports get, post, and TIMEOUT from utils.http so the package\nhas a clean public surface (from utils import get, post) in addition\nto the existing direct imports used by the test files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1c9789838ee7d2df167f53b171163bf082628ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/git/trees/b1c9789838ee7d2df167f53b171163bf082628ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/git/commits/41ada50e25ae1bac0ab8bb88854f8876c295cd6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/khviyer/Personal-Project/commit/41ada50e25ae1bac0ab8bb88854f8876c295cd6a","node_id":"C_kwDOReQvkdoAKDQxYWRhNTBlMjVhZTFiYWMwYWI4YmI4ODg1NGY4ODc2YzI5NWNkNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khviyer/Personal-Project/commit/3c495da9c309711d4c96833ee6fabf5e1a81e170","sha":"3c495da9c309711d4c96833ee6fabf5e1a81e170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/commits/3c495da9c309711d4c96833ee6fabf5e1a81e170"}],"sha":"41ada50e25ae1bac0ab8bb88854f8876c295cd6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/commits/41ada50e25ae1bac0ab8bb88854f8876c295cd6a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/commits/3c495da9c309711d4c96833ee6fabf5e1a81e170/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T16:21:21Z","email":"vishwanathan@TP067-MBP.local","name":"Vishwanathan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T16:21:21Z","email":"vishwanathan@TP067-MBP.local","name":"Vishwanathan"},"message":"Implement NLP Baseline Evaluation Module (Tasks 4–18)\n\nTasks implemented:\n- Task 4:  Result schema documentation (docs/result_schema.md) + 3 sample records (configs/sample_results.jsonl)\n- Task 5:  JSONL serializer with deterministic key ordering (src/evaluation/results/serializer.py)\n- Task 6:  JSONL deserializer with schema validation (src/evaluation/results/deserializer.py)\n- Task 7:  Unit tests for serialization round-trip, schema mismatch, invalid records (tests/test_result_serialization.py)\n- Task 8:  KPI definitions — Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1, MRR, nDCG, Latency P95, Coverage (docs/kpi_definitions.md)\n- Task 9:  Success criteria YAML config + loader (configs/success_criteria.yaml, src/evaluation/config/success_config.py)\n- Task 11: Service connectivity env vars added to .env.example + docs (docs/service_connectivity.md)\n- Task 12: Connectivity check script with DNS, TLS, auth, and health checks (scripts/connectivity_check.sh)\n- Task 13: Evaluation pipeline CLI — eval-module run --dataset/--out/--mock (scripts/eval-module)\n- Task 14: Mock fixtures for regex, NLP, and OpenSearch services (configs/fixtures/)\n- Task 15: BaseClient ABC + MockClients + RealClients with USE_MOCK_SERVICES toggle (src/services/)\n- Task 16: End-to-end pipeline tests covering mock mode, dataset mode, schema validation, success criteria (tests/test_evaluation_pipeline.py)\n- Task 18: Full README with setup, Docker, pipeline, mock mode, configuration, troubleshooting\n\nAll 26 unit tests pass. eval-module run --mock produces perfect scores on sample dataset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21f8d93a80ea15bf78d6160db2d5c8dfc581dd27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/git/trees/21f8d93a80ea15bf78d6160db2d5c8dfc581dd27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khviyer/Personal-Project/git/commits/3c495da9c309711d4c96833ee6fabf5e1a81e170","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/khviyer/Personal-Project/commit/3c495da9c309711d4c96833ee6fabf5e1a81e170","node_id":"C_kwDOReQvkdoAKDNjNDk1ZGE5YzMwOTcxMWQ0Yzk2ODMzZWU2ZmFiZjVlMWE4MWUxNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khviyer/Person