minglow","node_id":"U_kgDOCfUDkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hongminglow/under-the-hood/commits/3656e49b64903cc4758b42f81d092e3f879da3a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T02:52:41Z","email":"hongming_1212@hotmail.com","name":"ming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T02:52:41Z","email":"hongming_1212@hotmail.com","name":"ming"},"message":"refactor(ui): rework theming into a dark/light system on a calm forest-green palette\n\nReplace the single hardcoded emerald theme with a tokenized, runtime-switchable\ntheme system (dark default + light) tuned for long-form reading comfort.\n\n- Theme tokens as CSS variables in index.css (:root light / .dark dark) wired via\n  @theme inline; class-based dark variant; no-flash pre-paint script + useTheme hook\n  + ThemeToggle in the header, persisted to localStorage\n- Calm forest-green palette: soft off-white body text, saturated green reserved for\n  the accent, background lifted off pure black to reduce eye strain\n- Make all UI components theme-aware (Card, Callout, Highlight, MistakeCard, Step,\n  Table, CodeBlock, Flow, FeatureCard); accent maps carry a light base + dark: override\n- Migrate every topic for light mode (light text/inset/border bases) and calm\n  dark-mode bold/highlight emphasis (-300 -> -400) to avoid glare\n- Fix theme conflicts: Table/CodeBlock emerald rendering red; emerald cards holding\n  red content (recolor to green, negative cards switched to rose)\n- Improve search ranking: weight tags > title > description, ignoreLocation, and\n  boost exact tag/title/id so the exact topic name always ranks first\n- Document the theme system, palette, light/dark rules, and tagging convention in SKILL.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d2cbc4453b4243f49d2c14a3a67ac8d62173a59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hongminglow/under-the-hood/git/trees/6d2cbc4453b4243f49d2c14a3a67ac8d62173a59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hongminglow/under-the-hood/git/commits/3656e49b64903cc4758b42f81d092e3f879da3a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167052178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hongminglow","id":167052178,"login":"hongminglow","node_id":"U_kgDOCfUDkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongminglow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hongminglow/under-the-hood/commit/3656e49b64903cc4758b42f81d092e3f879da3a9","node_id":"C_kwDOReaXEtoAKDM2NTZlNDliNjQ5MDNjYzQ3NThiNDJmODFkMDkyZTNmODc5ZGEzYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hongminglow/under-the-hood/commit/05481023e61b1b3725eda2728c1a69be58189b6d","sha":"05481023e61b1b3725eda2728c1a69be58189b6d","url"