vatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bekacru","id":86073083,"login":"Bekacru","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDczMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bekacru/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bekacru/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bekacru/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bekacru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bekacru/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bekacru","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/commits/e2dbb567c8f6afaa4f3eacf031e4e6a19fac3771/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:40:54Z","email":"86073083+Bekacru@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bereket Engida"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:40:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(auth): add Better Auth guidance to the auth skill (#181)\n\nBetter Auth is now Vercel''s open-source auth library, so the auth skill\nleads with it: install with Marketplace Neon Postgres, env vars with\npreview-deployment guidance, server config with nextCookies + cookie\ncache + the `vercel` social provider, route handler, migrations, client\nusage, server session access, cookie-only proxy.ts protection, a\n\"Keep It Fast on Vercel\" checklist, a plugin table, and an Agent Tooling\nblock pointing to `npx skills add better-auth/skills`, llms.txt, and the\ndocs MCP server.\n\nFrontmatter: trigger on `better-auth` imports/installs, `npx auth@latest`,\nlib/auth*.ts, app/api/auth/[...all], and proxy.ts. The hand-rolled Vercel\nOAuth validate rule now skips Better Auth configs, whose `vercel` provider\nlegitimately reads VERCEL_CLIENT_ID/SECRET. chainTo messages name Better\nAuth and skip files already using it.\n\nRegenerated skill-manifest.json and skill-catalog.md.","tree":{"sha":"68ffccac6bc7e3d0deba6a7cc3fa8582ba5358cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/68ffccac6bc7e3d0deba6a7cc3fa8582ba5358cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/e2dbb567c8f6afaa4f3eacf031e4e6a19fac3771","verification":{"payload":"tree 68ffccac6bc7e3d0deba6a7cc3fa8582ba5358cc\nparent c6c5dfb3f7d0f4e9915501ccce1e827e68bb2386\nauthor Bereket Engida <86073083+Bekacru@users.noreply.github.com> 1791052854 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791052854 +0200\n\nfeat(auth): add Better Auth guidance to the auth skill (#181)\n\nBetter Auth is now Vercel''s open-source auth library, so the auth skill\nleads with it: install with Marketplace Neon Postgres, env vars with\npreview-deployment guidance, server config with nextCookies + cookie\ncache + the `vercel` social provider, route handler, migrations, client\nusage, server session access, cookie-only proxy.ts protection, a\n\"Keep It Fast on Vercel\" checklist, a plugin table, and an Agent Tooling\nblock pointing to `npx skills add better-auth/skills`, llms.txt, and the\ndocs MCP server.\n\nFrontmatter: trigger on `better-auth` imports/installs, `npx auth@latest`,\nlib/auth*.ts, app/api/auth/[...all], and proxy.ts. The hand-rolled Vercel\nOAuth validate rule now skips Better Auth configs, whose `vercel` provider\nlegitimately reads VERCEL_CLIENT_ID/SECRET. chainTo messages name Better\nAuth and skip files already using it.\n\nRegenerated skill-manifest.json and skill-catalog.md.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwUw2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvaAQADH1rJilqVmI/GeoFNEAqjIg\nxLZatWXgw5iF5w6h/x+kHw37PBgU8QbnNYPPlzHQH3FaWGnPMjR08Q4GgVklvlP0\nfNFeNYpUE7+M3yWTCRBTQ3ffGQbNxvrSqq1XVuoxZv1jMGtwyxHO7foVqFZTEigm\nUgUdOqTPUwM6sfNoSoGeeLDu1mA4lElF8D69Pcn4GzAHOg112OlBBtB7M3aG4nwt\nVx41K9UJSOBDEiWsgeshWDGmFZKcmRblrg6Xu7Y4B8PR+ecsxU148J0eYDu6SfI2\nGW3UojmS3enVvUSFAN4+WcLOLcupIuBtvKjBCtoSDOBuwiJ3OtBsQLXd0x2oaFfd\nAZcSubg6HKki/AhCs3orX/M/y5FuwNyTkVwqYG+dY+A2gR1FiuC4yo5TC15GLruj\nrmo/ZXK8Y+pbgUZlSbbFKx