in node_modules/next/dist/docs/ (with AGENTS.md generated\nby `next dev` on 16.3+), and workflow skills live in vercel/next.js.\n\nRemove the nextjs, next-upgrade, next-cache-components, and turbopack\nskills and every reference to them, and point agents at the official\nguidance instead (knowledge-update, vercel.md, performance-optimizer,\ncdn-caching, routing-middleware validate message).\n\nSupersedes #121.","tree":{"sha":"416610ccb92e9fc28e1ea932b07624b2760f6ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/416610ccb92e9fc28e1ea932b07624b2760f6ab8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/ee6f76288c4f8c34c485dc4649c7f2b3c9f2ef9d","verification":{"payload":"tree 416610ccb92e9fc28e1ea932b07624b2760f6ab8\nparent b06012d841e1767664c1d2125d02e0c42522e3ab\nauthor Rich Haines <hello@richardhaines.dev> 1790846423 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790846423 +0200\n\n[skills] Remove the Next.js framework skills in favor of Next.js''s bundled docs (#282)\n\nNext.js retired vercel-labs/next-skills: reference knowledge now ships\nversion-matched in node_modules/next/dist/docs/ (with AGENTS.md generated\nby `next dev` on 16.3+), and workflow skills live in vercel/next.js.\n\nRemove the nextjs, next-upgrade, next-cache-components, and turbopack\nskills and every reference to them, and point agents at the official\nguidance instead (knowledge-update, vercel.md, performance-optimizer,\ncdn-caching, routing-middleware validate message).\n\nSupersedes #121.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqviXXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAanIQAFakdzH5Yagjgc7vKVcxntK9\nFpqQfvCYO5h2BIgnbQAgUjXrR0EYAOcxD/Vy8XukcVFadH9cDRiqw/+HM3yPhO6U\neh1ZElcIucwfreuDUSluWkGnC6hiUUYb8LeKsZBNKBKkprt4zxcHqhAyFVtkwKem\nXl5RD0D560K50vgmr5GLTR3hEAbaGTk8qmx+MQejQxJYn/NubT4PsuU9JPREV01h\nEuouvpSbpTwt7/c8wyeWlJawR426HvWaOdVOz9/bDH+d2/ro0JVRmS1li84B5jru\nWMlLM6qCIqRYBP2ZZHdg4dQtSRk7zsscyykcK16ZjzJl6sZ2Ge+UlzHxLSc8EED5\nzCNHVV5jhl