":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109001280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joshuasoup","id":109001280,"login":"joshuasoup","node_id":"U_kgDOBn86QA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuasoup","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/commits/b06012d841e1767664c1d2125d02e0c42522e3ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:02:04Z","email":"joshuasouphanthong55@gmail.com","name":"Josh Souphanthong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:02:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Use live deployment status views from the Vercel MCP (#281)\n\n* Use live deployment status views from the Vercel MCP\n\nThe Vercel MCP server now exposes open_preview_deployment and\nopen_deployments_dashboard, which render as live MCP Apps views in\nChatGPT and Codex and return text summaries elsewhere.\n\n- /deploy opens the preview status after deploying\n- /status opens the deployments dashboard before falling back to vercel ls\n- deployments-cicd points to a new references/live-status.md; the skill\n  body stays within the 12 KB injection budget\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Point live deployment guidance at open_deployments\n\nThe Vercel MCP server now serves the preview and dashboard views from one\ntool, open_deployments, selected with view. Update /deploy, /status, and\nthe deployments-cicd live-status reference, and describe finding the\nproject from the git remote, the monorepo chooser, and Send Logs to Chat\nasking the agent to investigate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28dc4d08d01297c4a98f18dab3e6e82b4ee8c8f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/28dc4d08d01297c4a98f18dab3e6e82b4ee8c8f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/b06012d841e1767664c1d2125d02e0c42522e3ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 28dc4d08d01297c4a98f18dab3e6e82b4ee8c8f1\nparent ce31fdf6ea222def1b48d7ce2c01cb5f3ef5b88f\nauthor Josh Souphanthong <joshuasouphanthong55@gmail.com> 1790841724 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790841724 +0200\n\nUse live deployment status views from the Vercel MCP (#281)\n\n* Use live deployment status views from the Vercel MCP\n\nThe Vercel MCP server now exposes open_preview_deployment and\nopen_deployments_dashboard, which render as live MCP Apps views in\nChatGPT and Codex and return text summaries elsewhere.\n\n- /deploy opens the preview status after deploying\n- /status opens the deployments dashboard before falling back to vercel ls\n- deployments-cicd points to a new references/live-status.md; the skill\n  body stays within the 12 KB injection budget\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Point live deployment guidance at open_deployments\n\nThe Vercel MCP server now serves the preview and dashboard views from one\ntool, open_deployments, selected with view. Update /deploy, /status, and\nthe deployments-cicd live-status reference, and describe finding the\nproject from the git remote, the monorepo chooser, and Send Logs to Chat\nasking the agent to investigate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>