com/users/vercel-gh-bot-5%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-5%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel-gh-bot-5%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/commits/a17b3087aadec62c0d511aa155358a997929567f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:28:14Z","email":"312521305+vercel-gh-bot-5[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vercel-gh-bot-5[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:28:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[skills] Sync shadcn with current docs (#261)\n\n* [skills] Sync shadcn with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(shadcn): prefix namespaced registry keys with @\n\nThe shadcn registry schema requires registry names to start with @, so the acme/private keys in the namespaced example were invalid. Also note that index registries like @ai-elements need no components.json entry.\n\n* fix(shadcn): registries from the index still get a components.json entry, just not a manual one\n\nThe CLI looks the registry up in the index and writes it into components.json (\"add it to your components.json file\", shadcn registry-index docs), so \"need no components.json entry\" overstated it.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-5[bot] <312521305+vercel-gh-bot-5[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","tree":{"sha":"40147a8f1ab95f8743ea7b218a01ad2fbae6ac20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/40147a8f1ab95f8743ea7b218a01ad2fbae6ac20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/a17b3087aadec62c0d511aa155358a997929567f","verification":{"payload":"tree 40147a8f1ab95f8743ea7b218a01ad2fbae6ac20\nparent 3b7ad6f7c7bbc30990469467db4b454163aadd44\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-5[bot] <312521305+vercel-gh-bot-5[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790364494 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790364494 +0200\n\n[skills] Sync shadcn with current docs (#261)\n\n* [skills] Sync shadcn with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(shadcn): prefix namespaced registry keys with @\n\nThe shadcn registry schema requires registry names to start with @, so the acme/private keys in the namespaced example were invalid. Also note that index registries like @ai-elements need no components.json entry.\n\n* fix(shadcn): registries from the index still get a components.json entry, just not a manual one\n\nThe CLI looks the registry up in the index and writes it into components.json (\"add it to your components.json file\", shadcn registry-index docs), so \"need no components.json entry\" overstated it.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-5[bot] <312521305+vercel-gh-bot-5[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtstOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3uUQAF1SJ+l+/KWqz09wpLD/U3p0\n4W87KlZEc5LssxTeRjcuUT2EmQ/q/33L45R7A3m6FzdSPOs+n9L04fPhYAB2BXt7\nYOVSl8eSYN0VxNC3P4Jt88ewbNurtnJxCiLFnMMyS2apzHILBN5tzueNQwFJK3/R\nMvrPa22SRAotPoTPJ7dvemuQZVbxg2GAGzpzwM9Cf+U0Ou+a/zPA4JQvFccg1KkC\n/yw0zeEdajcvdwAjT2o39YzrZPADkJZnSKJ4JogQIPIxp4d4nbyxDp0FqUD8J1i2\nN2EP4iwDmgaPxhT4FmllWOvFmlZ96aRaYqoUEPbRUQDXSyX3QZGK0kHJ+e/Lt1s6\nOar8oeZnK2/boh5bsyjH9jsERu9OmYSJCakooULnT9R6gxoxYgwppGFp/zHeEnE9\nC+elc6n/HmQtVNTLS9z80UPKP37BsexJoWXE2rQKS6Zz2WlwJk7Sk6eFyvqPwhEQ\nTB1plO7nsePG7t8Lqm05MUHO4121tkzJPh5On6Y1xAkBE/tTAUo1ypV5aYrpwyDT\ntWOuKdySaDr1R4fuGQo/yzweANEjt8zp7LIC0Q+a8CWIPJWecrTQWln9oBk3Pex3\nRa24OPY61200qrYe4fF/0eR38igfPssgxzA8gwOZQ/zEXQwnRzQ7c4ACSXiv4BSn\nCr+isAmVcTYAXMPB5xVo\n=G+9G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T19:28:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"