 of the app.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","tree":{"sha":"deb3e4e8589dcb4faefd8a6fdb983183ac4b8c03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/deb3e4e8589dcb4faefd8a6fdb983183ac4b8c03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/b9f6f2aeb3bc99b7308b6dcf83d1324aa4b87da1","verification":{"payload":"tree deb3e4e8589dcb4faefd8a6fdb983183ac4b8c03\nparent 8dd20004a7e7f44e78d119d52e30cba2564a8e1b\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790364456 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790364456 +0200\n\n[skills] Sync routing-middleware with current docs (#259)\n\n* [skills] Sync routing-middleware with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(routing-middleware): give Next.js''s stated reasons for the proxy rename\n\nThe proxy.js reference (\"Why the Change\", \"Why Proxy\"): \"middleware\" was confused with Express.js middleware, the feature is recommended only as a last resort while better APIs arrive, and \"proxy\" implies a network boundary in front of the app.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-4[bot] <312518292+vercel-gh-bot-4[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtssoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA2YQAHcJrrdDZAQN/imuXnFOYEwV\nLrSeZbWnUJO2t/UU2kEdTLnxmy+6DI+yVAXgMpizYh56sK/pBnRjPlLoznt8wtP0\nFiW4+RGpr5Iz3o2IsfLQT7I6zHP/Xwxh2yfAeyF9wTSiy5uEl9u5z8jWdtMWSp+y\noJO8XG7vdutn2aHMyeBihePQgByyTuPypPJRjCSCiB2cxQgquVxkezA1UgMGXhip\nv4wK0CanGecd2sLQBQ770hbwzmGOQEkMBq82ImhLXnM/62o4D3yn8FxEU/qXbJc5\nn5O3+UwNMVWatliIU2lJjxuRATfEylhuENEOihrdWjpWHlTD30UmTe336IKzfzI8\n+QWENtlBGfdbmn/BAolwww4oUA4bhCpPDzu1zqyBUTeKbstHxYKdKsnv9WaqiGYA\naJ+on7pSXY45WUBd6OAW4qMqnnLkMjvZMeGXhYs+SrDOtsx3WMZoj7YNezLeR2jX\nL/xf3enP6BJs/hw0oUSqeF7gng/Fh9pvW