e\" claim:\n  destination.path selects which route runs inside the service and\n  a query string in it adds matchable state to the service''s own\n  rules, but it does not change the path the service code sees\n- Keep the guidance that changing the path the code sees needs a\n  service-scoped rewrite or a request.path transform\n- Link the Services routing docs\n- Test the corrected wording and the removal of the old claim","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtkPaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8loQAGcVDcuXvbuxShJuU84c6sLf\n4ysSmkKjnsD1gMTir92iNraEezxQ4gjKRcvE/tdE/Zs+0iwpdWAdOaXgAqT3konR\npqEiqinepE5PU9kC7X+br5exwkFUdhNmtu0SBewyRLR1SBea7rQq77VZQAtZl72M\n89cgpQP4UHti90fQVRh6PffNMUYQiYQw6dqvSp+oYlsmTzy9n+TE3YlcRUgbLqMi\n/q9Cob7GDYoydv94NhiVDxvf8EY2R5tzCHQDDkm2Yu0y7teRvGxL6npYJyLX06HV\nieDLGKHjiiM7R/jjSkYjYnseUi03RExL17GI1k5btkONAu4ahI4fUO5MCN2A6qTp\nJCv2NwBXVIr8biMRCdSAPWH2B1HLDKj7fS8cQ6lGaD5ePt2R1IION1VWp17Gqd6p\nHpF+4fwTop7zwxzY2qnYLmu9Vv48L8aAyIsBBGIikIMtSefY+ju1O2YdGhgUvobp\nDJZxW6VbuRMra6YdKmTSJepPpXBfq/y/MaL8S7OJ2sn6pvj9eQotnWMDwPWxGFG4\njGwUVcK/a6WXal4pnMyEsD9v5yVWyqnlpLCFi1kXozNwle/yon9EIvJu9xvrEmQ7\nU/L7sj/0OptEtmbbcPp9VGLruOqbiJSdhkiUkrXhDrjXi9ju+IjEHhM9v78CM70Q\nLEYehtUgkRsa1uJnGsWE\n=bV0Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:50:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u