IxMDRhNTU0MzNkOTcwOGE5Y2NiNzk2OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vercel-plugin/commit/8d554c0c47ceb99736e36c2c4f95876c69b93756","sha":"8d554c0c47ceb99736e36c2c4f95876c69b93756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/commits/8d554c0c47ceb99736e36c2c4f95876c69b93756"}],"sha":"1e13545b5ec696cb104a55433d9708a9ccb7968d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/commits/1e13545b5ec696cb104a55433d9708a9ccb7968d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16890942?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gustavovalverde","id":16890942,"login":"gustavovalverde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODkwOTQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gustavovalverde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/commits/8d554c0c47ceb99736e36c2c4f95876c69b93756/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:50:17Z","email":"g.valverde02@gmail.com","name":"Gustavo Valverde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:50:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vercel-services): guide projects that use experimentalServices (#229)\n\n* fix(vercel-services): guide projects that use experimentalServices\n\n- Add references/experimental-services.md: recognizing the earlier\n  model, how routing differs from the services model, a field\n  migration table, and the both-keys validation error\n- Point agents that find experimentalServices to the reference from\n  the \"Define services and public ingress\" section\n- Add a Troubleshoot bullet for the both-keys validation error\n- Add the experimental docs URL to metadata.docs and\n  experimentalServices to retrieval.entities\n- Test the reference file exists, is linked from SKILL.md, and\n  documents the both-keys error\n\n* fix(vercel-services): note the includeFiles type change and use request.path to reshape paths\n\n- Under services.functions, includeFiles and excludeFiles take a single glob string. experimentalServices also accepts an array, so moving an array value as-is fails validation.\n- /docs/services/routing names a request.path transform in the service''s own routes as the way to change the path service code sees.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5b51889d1f1f6a3a3ef7c683c1773ec1ee94ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/c5b51889d1f1f6a3a3ef7c683c1773ec1ee94ada"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/8d554c0c47ceb99736e36c2c4f95876c69b93756","verification":{"payload":"tree c5b51889d1f1f6a3a3ef7c683c1773ec1ee94ada\nparent 1f105c4f2511546f006cc9b54caab79e3174150d\nauthor Gustavo Valverde <g.valverde02@gmail.com> 1790329817 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790329817 +0200\n\nfix(vercel-services): guide projects that use experimentalServices (#229)\n\n* fix(vercel-services): guide projects that use experimentalServices\n\n- Add references/experimental-services.md: recognizing the earlier\n  model, how routing differs from the services model, a field\n  migration table, and the both-keys validation error\n- Point agents that find experimentalServices to the reference from\n  the \"Define services and public ingress\" section\n- Add a Troubleshoot bullet for the both-keys validation error\n- Add the experimental docs URL to metadata.docs and\n  experimentalServices to retrieval.entities\n- Test the reference file exists, is linked from SKILL.md, and\n  documents the both-keys error\n\n* fix(vercel-services): note the includeFiles type change and use request.path to reshape paths\n\n- Under services.functions, includeFiles and excludeFiles take a single glob string. experimentalServices also accepts an array, so moving an array value as-is fails validation.\n- /docs/services/routing names a request.path transform in the service''s own routes as the way to change the path service code sees.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtkPZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABsgQAEkrIuhI/ARSFFFFEv8L1w/G\nSuRUd9myh/xrJaRtXm5IdwnyCgtebPEtk56dFZzzkihuLhShfcT2GDQc9WDDcJa7\nA2zDftcC3+QKalX0AAdeZUr6RQvs1A0/6YAySIC4wD9kSUL0BxSW6po7zp9QvpNP\nY7l/Cvo5qQamMIu67YifNoXDYDpeDh0QlyzSNEdYgpTUsg5h/iOKR6WZs1qPFvhn\nX8liWAZ1gK7i2AZEecHI53K4OsKQPdPp81hNEBFUdwkFMe2edFRsv6h36+smFr2d\nJ/MGM8qVabINk5xqWOCYvZPJROoOtXdf67T9q2ACAsvGS83xx91ShXtaGMX9YycO\njaVXXyz1YKQ09yKM7SZE/38XW/NuP7JXq7axxeePO9iTxWiLE9v1ASr1AP2o/IAx\nnum1CgHqhKCqsa0VXAxpLKE37407VlwfxoDftMITF29r+i6IBiM5tkPGlsJH5bIu\n2STEQ89m9kIBPogIJ1IlGIkwOxWI3QlteLn2r3I93y29cVNSl7ZTVrp1bRxm91Yr\n2qO/e9MvpL5t340lPlAGTA5LN6cjTOTR19pdc06CB/0lPCPMTtewBv1JyxnblXwT\n1J3iCEHtY+kDgFj5a3qomCDlAcnQ5bZJ61JLtSlPhxvVvtdRr1uY7/holBqlPbTx\naNR20POTEKlAYZsKGGm6\n=s2iO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:50:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-