the experimental_createWorkflow row from the vercel.md migration\n  table.\n- Point the ai-architect agent at the workflow skill, and validate skill\n  references in agent and command templates and plugin-owned skills.\n\n* test(workflow): @vercel/workflow is private, not missing\n\nA restricted @vercel/workflow package exists in the Vercel npm org (v0.0.3, the pre-launch name). It isn''t public, so the change stands; only the comment''s wording was off.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bd251a60a5f3f41177f251cfcde8dc971af8310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/9bd251a60a5f3f41177f251cfcde8dc971af8310"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/2d19b4897acf97043eb105306bf09b950f60a368","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bd251a60a5f3f41177f251cfcde8dc971af8310\nparent dc7a3b7773f63209df214bf98ff949a9d2f13ac4\nauthor Gustavo Valverde <g.valverde02@gmail.com> 1790329334 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790329334 +0200\n\nfix(workflow): drop references to packages, APIs, and skills that do not exist (#233)\n\n* fix(workflow): drop references to packages, APIs, and skills that do not exist\n\n- Match and profile the published workflow package instead of\n  @vercel/workflow, which npm does not have.\n- Remove validate rules and skip patterns for createWorkflow and\n  experimental_createWorkflow, which neither workflow nor ai exports;\n  createWorkflow is Mastra''s API.\n- Remove the experimental_createWorkflow row from the vercel.md migration\n  table.\n- Point the ai-architect agent at the workflow skill, and validate skill\n  references in agent and command templates and plugin-owned skills.\n\n* test(workflow): @vercel/workflow is private, not missing\n\nA restricted @vercel/workflow package exists in the Vercel npm org (v0.0.3, the pre-launch name). It isn''t public, so the change stands; only the comment''s wording was off.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: m