skills] Sync vercel-connect with current docs (#250)\n\n* [skills] Sync vercel-connect with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(vercel-connect): make the MCP connector guidance consistent; add the attach step\n\n- Two ways to register an MCP server: a known service''s MCP method (linear/my-agent, as in /docs/mcp/integrations/eve), or a URL, which creates a custom OAuth connector (oauth/linear, as in /docs/connect/quickstart). The eve example''s linear/myagent now matches the text.\n- Replace the \"always pass the full MCP URL\" advice, which contradicted the docs'' `vercel connect create linear` example.\n- Add `vercel connect attach <connector>` after create. Both the quickstart and the eve MCP guide attach as a separate step.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","tree":{"sha":"b25948eda5816174cd322c2970ac0042aaba2e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/b25948eda5816174cd322c2970ac0042aaba2e09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/dc7a3b7773f63209df214bf98ff949a9d2f13ac4","verification":{"payload":"tree b25948eda5816174cd322c2970ac0042aaba2e09\nparent f3eb8ad5cd6374939fd36cca3fb9103225df09bc\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790328858 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790328858 +0200\n\n[skills] Sync vercel-connect with current docs (#250)\n\n* [skills] Sync vercel-connect with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(vercel-connect): make the MCP connector guidance consistent; add the attach step\n\n- Two ways to register an MCP server: a known service''s MCP method (linear/my-agent, as in /docs/mcp/integrations/eve), or a URL, which creates a custom OAuth connector (oauth/linear, as in /docs/connect/quickstart). The eve example''s linear/myagent now matches the text.\n- Replace the \"always pass the full MCP URL\" advice, which contradicted the docs'' `vercel connect create linear` example.\n- Add `vercel connect attach <connector>` after create. Both the quickstart and the eve MCP guide attach as a separate step.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtkAaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAziwQAAXf/2k+5wpjkt73WtSXRwVR\nY18yaM8RniT3jsO/Ou2A5zBWid4QPXIK70rx841VBtEE47kJ6VpHjPPoXc7+0mU5\nerLkZ1HEh4X5nEvuYt+fVVdJeirzIojgzrNYvXYGGB2eHaia/hLvRFUWehcjEqc7\nnCZJy+XimQvO2eEkhOckuPiNWZHLz2kshBqOOhdswGHjcr4GT5XDR/sFY6mzkn+W\nyuvjp7sAwKqKyb+zJlLhosUTAY3cwmjYs3PY4OKqUhNwj676T7VRXBiWTz9u8qpH\nMNrBbQVAQEZ2iu3Gc9zrCkI4wqO9bGKiJ+d17k4cLt920CUrOQAeuwU70RRuwPFx\nlL1JmiT+nOlpXZ2CAsc1g/5OqRz72COiNpcqLGXUbSZFCD5h8mIMwY/QFycRRjqq\nXpE/8466y7vj8NTSDCn7QJiHXmsPYhFHmOaZ1pDpSBZ7uZWOYuWzZFPhSV3eZZCx\n/XCYd09lo7qcl087g4JxOC6nYYHPoDqOWW5FBj6U3VK0AXY5KhfxFojRxe7O4sBl\nx0sJhfsPz0IrxOZYWFfDEBqtLsCEixCX56SnmL1q8adFHvRTUJfF4Z0O44hBYu+4\nHe/m1FKbkC+FOGVCqQre2RAQJrdz2RPXVHa1X+3vw2o0/M7fsS2ceElQ7zPyc0XG\n/txX5IsxnUaIIk2oQ/XF\n=i7oe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:34:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_adm