(#246)\n\n* [skills] Sync microfrontends with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(microfrontends): keep the bypass-secret setup and prerenderEagerness; correct add-to-group\n\n- Restore the VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET setup. @vercel/microfrontends 2.3.2 made it the preferred approach (\"This is the preferred approach now\"). The per-app AUTOMATION_BYPASS_<NAME> variable still works, but the docs page describing only that one is out of date.\n- Restore the prerenderEagerness prop. It exists in prefetch-cross-zone-links.tsx and the examples use it.\n- add-to-group always asks for confirmation (no --yes) and refuses --non-interactive past the free project limit. The flags only pre-fill the prompts.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","tree":{"sha":"951d9307d30a49037d1afa9a03037a82c5f2f1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/trees/951d9307d30a49037d1afa9a03037a82c5f2f1a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vercel-plugin/git/commits/0346ba03c54892fbe0f8cefd40d484d85585511d","verification":{"payload":"tree 951d9307d30a49037d1afa9a03037a82c5f2f1a1\nparent c3d97dfbe57e192b516ca952b1824c36010a1d81\nauthor vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790328774 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790328774 +0200\n\n[skills] Sync microfrontends with current docs (#246)\n\n* [skills] Sync microfrontends with current docs\n\n<!-- vercel-plugin-drift-agent -->\n\n* fix(microfrontends): keep the bypass-secret setup and prerenderEagerness; correct add-to-group\n\n- Restore the VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET setup. @vercel/microfrontends 2.3.2 made it the preferred approach (\"This is the preferred approach now\"). The per-app AUTOMATION_BYPASS_<NAME> variable still works, but the docs page describing only that one is out of date.\n- Restore the prerenderEagerness prop. It exists in prefetch-cross-zone-links.tsx and the examples use it.\n- add-to-group always asks for confirmation (no --yes) and refuses --non-interactive past the free project limit. The flags only pre-fill the prompts.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: vercel-gh-bot-2[bot] <282331341+vercel-gh-bot-2[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: molebox <rich@vercel.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtj/GCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcJQQADGURTa8NidW5pvyfj9uelYd\nwgpFDd+w6R2oRngzbob7KD/wvp1pVqz8YBLXVr4T0l+W8IdvM7gOvIsPNs4ACwH6\nF68/FqiTDxdFJp+9kCUTrNgLaVk+WdkiNbGCKq1T5iOtwtYx+5kaSbe+hVNRfmhj\n/34uiryS6ia1tPd/m8oRMtb3n9loOAjsKqtRsc0h2uJJRGqnsyPQ3T1rAwFmVVHV\nG3kn1nnrUrDeUq0dZmPHufmy4Bd/6Fv9KfM+LRvaWL/hwumZWUNWKuImwNRzBvob\nFNfY2g/uS2d+L6iUFMH9Akhvm5ADokbhSXaAQl2S+VNAgjiWrGIHEWC60yM1gU42\nOCrZOeXCbbkeJlvUqvsKijykKidBdSaNHyx0W9mWddwtRZNbwiDWvEqxny8S6e2o\nAP3AHVmXaGM2zAJiS8O2hAbx++r0GEVoGAbsfx3hkOZXo9+Z50MEqd4oXRNypDJm\nSWSWnW/eWPpaR13WDBvbXhfuc6/JvnhLdkrULUpr0fCOpwnpM2QdFqUP+/I93TcJ\naf965/J32jNhy+xln5mbOLklRbi5/rw6s4AIwWRT//Qce9qMAURDb0dKDYyIDLXG\nlJ+hGCmEV49/MDrQnzMNKjWt38HdpEMCn6Qy4uQt1/a4Sq5tqvYRPmaie9gSGC+6\n6uy63daTmRHQmlbxCuHx\n=hOMQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:32:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"s